<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Yohane ya chitabu chimwe mna pfitabu pfine ipfili mna Laghano lya Sambi ipfilangusa mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chimwe chokemighwa “Injili” (mana yake Imbuli inoghile). Pfitabu pfino tsapfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Imbuli Inoghile ino tsayandikighwa na Yohane mna ghumwaka ka ghwa tisini kulawa Yesu helekeghwe. Hata ka chitabu chino ng'achilangusa bae ka Yohane iye yandike, lekeni pfachandikighwe cheghala na ibaluwa ya mwanduso ya Yohane, ya keli na ya kadatu. Iwanu iwang'ali wakwandika wa ghumwande wolonga Yohane tsakakala mna ghumji ghwa Efeso, apfo yakoneka chitabu chino tsachandikighwa mne ghumji ghwa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohane kolonga mwatsimwatsi ka ichinu chikulu ichili mne chitabu chino, ukuwapfila iwanu watoghole ka Yesu iye Kiristu, Mwana we Imulungu iyali mghima (20:31). Kwa ukutoghola apfo twakuwa waghima mne taghwa lyake. Ichitabu chino tsachandikighwa kwa pfilongotsi wa Wayahudi na wa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. Imbuli Inoghile ya Yohane ng'aighala bae na Imbuli Inoghile ya Matei Luka na Maliki. Yohane tsakakomangitsa ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfatendile Yesu, na ng'andike bae mbuli tse mifano yalapfile Yesu. Pfinu pfimwenga ka ukubatitsighwa kwa Yesu na ukughetsighwa kwake kunyika, ng'apfandikighwe bae mne Imbuli inoghile ino.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-18, Yohane kakwandusa Imbuli Inoghile</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:19-12:50, kakwandika ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa pfatendile Yesu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 13:1-20:31, kolonga mengi ighalawile mne ughima wa Yesu na ukufa kwake na ukutsilihuka kwake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 21, Yohane komalitsila kwa kulonga Yesu pfawalawile iwanu ahala hatsilihuke na ichinu chimtendile yeye yandike chitabu chino.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye Ughima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Aho mwanduso ng'ana pfinu pfose pfilumbighwe yumwe yakemighwe Imbuli tsakabaho. Imbuli ayo tsakakala ne Imulungu, naye tsakakala Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yeye tsakakala ne Imulungu kulawa mwanduso. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kubitila yeye pfinu pfose tsapfilumbighwa, kuduhu ichinu ichilumbighwe bila yeye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yeye tsakakala mwanduso wa ughima, na ughima awo tsaukala ghumwanga kwe iwanu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ghumwanga ghomwemwesela ichisi, na ichisi ng'achidaha bae kughutsima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tsakulawila imunu yumwe iyatumighwe ne Imulungu, taghwa lyake Yohane. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohane tsakatsa kuwalongela iwanu mbuli tse ghumwanga, ili iwanu wose wahulike, waghutoghole. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yeye imwenyegho ng'awile bae ghumwanga, ila katsa kuwalongela iwanu imbuli ye ghumwanga. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Aghuno ghukala ghumwanga ghwa kweli, ghumwanga ighung'ali ghukutsa muisi kumwemwesela iwanu wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imbuli tsakakala muisi, na hata ka Imulungu tsakalumba isi kubitila yeye, iwanu ng'awamtangile bae. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tsakatsa ukaye yake, lekeni iwanu wake ng'awambokele bae. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bali iwanu wose iwambokele, awala iwamtoghole, kawatenda wadahe kuwa iwana we Imulungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwana ing'awelekighwe bae kwa uwetso we iwanu, wala kwe ngupfu tsa lukuli au unoghelo we iwanu, ila kwa uwetso we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Na Imbuli ayo kawa imunu, naye kakala hamwe na twetwe. Na twetwe tuwona utunitso wake, utunitso we Imwana nyalimwe, iyatsile kulawa kwa Aba, kamema uluso na ukweli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohane tsakalonga mbuli tsake. Tsakakemelela, “Ayuno iyo iyaniwalongele, ‘Ayo iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu mkulu kubita nene kwaapfila tsakabaha ng'ana nene nyelekighwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwa ukutimila kwa uluso wake twetwe twose tubokela ng'ani. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakatwing'a Ghamalaghitso kubitila Musa, lekeni uluso na ukweli pfakutsa kubitila Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu wowose iyamwonile Imulungu. Ila Imwana yaliyeka, yeghalile ne Imulungu iyelungile na Aba, iyo iyatulongele mbuli tse Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 3:1-12; Maliki 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Auno iwo ukalangama wa Yohane, iwakulu wa Wayahudi wa Yerusalemu hawawatumile iwatambika wakulu na Walawi waghende kwa Yohane, kumghutsa yeye tsakakala nani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yohane tsakatoghola na ng'alemile bae kuwedika mwatsimwatsi, tsakalonga, “Nene sili Kiristu bae, iyokombola iwanu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani? Pfii ghweghwe kwa Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yohane kawedika, “Mbe, si nene bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamghutsa keli, “Lelo ghweghwe kwa ayula Nabii iyalongighwe katsakutsa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kawedika, “Bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya wamghutsa, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani? Ghweghwe mwenyegho ulongatse? Tulongele lelo, na twetwe tukawalongele yawatutumile tukughutse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohane kawedika ka pfayalongile nabii Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nene na ‘litsi lye imunu iyokema kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q">Muigholose inzila ye Imtwatsa!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya Mafarisayo wangi iwatumighwe <verse number="25" style="v"/>wamghutsa Yohane, “Ka ghweghwe si Kiristu, wala Eliya, wala ayula Nabii, ule kwobatitsa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohane kawedika, “Nene nobatitsa kwa ghamatsi, lekeni mghati mwenu kuna yumwe yang'amummanyile. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ayo iyo yuyo iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu. Nene sibamighwa bae hata kudohola imitsabi ya imikwabatsa yake.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">5. Imunu kakoa imitsabi ye imikwabatsa</figure></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Agha ghose ghalawila Betaniya, kumwambu kwa ghumto Yoridani, Yohane kwang'ali yobatitsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Imwana Ing'olo we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya keli Yohane kamwona Yesu komtsila, kalonga, “Mlole! Imwana Ing'olo we Imulungu iyosola nzambi tse isi yose! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ayuno iyo yuyo yanilongile mbuli tsake, haniwalongele pfino, ‘Imunu iyakutsa kuchughu kwangu mkulu kubita nene kwaapfila tsakabaha nene ng'ana nyelekighwe.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nene imwenyegho tsasimmanyile bae, ila nitsa kubatitsa kwa ghamatsi, ili iwanu wa Isiraeli wammanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kuya Yohane kalapfa ukalangama, “Nimwona Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kohulumka kulawa kulanga ka injiwa, kakala mchanya mwake. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nene tsasimmanyile bae, lekeni ayula iyanitumile kubatitsa kwa ghamatsi kanongela, ‘Imunu yutsomwona Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka komhulumkila na kukala mchanya mwake, ayo katsobatitsa kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka.’ ” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kuya Yohane kalonga, “Nichona chinu acho, na nene nowalongela ghendo, ayuno iyo yuyo Imwana we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanang'ina wa mwanduso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Litsuwa iliwinzile, Yohane tsakabahala keli ne iwanang'ina wake weli. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hayamwonile Yesu koluta, kalonga, “Mlole! Imwana Ng'olo we Imulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina weli hawamuhulike Yohane kolonga apfi, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu kahunduka, kawona womuwinza, kawaghutsa, “Angu mbama choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wedika, “Rabi, angu ukala kwani?” Rabi mana yake Mlangulitsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kawedika, “Mtse mwone.” Waghenda, wona hanu hang'ali yokala Yesu. Tsaikala ka saa kumi nemihe. Nawo wakala na Yesu nemihe yose ila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Andereya, ndughu yake Simoni Petiri, kakala yumwe mna iwanu iwahulike achila chayalongile Yohane, na iwamuwinzile Yesu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bahala, Andereya kambama ndughu yake Simoni, kamlongela, “Tumwona Mkombotsi iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu!” Ayo iyo Kiristu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kuya Andereya kamsola Simoni kamghala kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlola kalonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Simoni imwana wa Yohane. Kutsokemighwa Kefa.” Kefa kwa Chigiriki Petiri, Petiri mana yake bambalawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema Filipi na Nasanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>L itsuwa liwinzile Yesu kalamla kughenda Galilaya. Kamwona Filipi, kamlongela, “Niwinze!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filipi, tsakakala imunu wa isi ya Betisaida, isi yawang'ali wokala Andereya na Petiri. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Filipi kamwona Nasanaeli, kamlongela, “Tumwona imunu yula iyandikighwe mbuli tsake na Musa mne chitabu cha Ghamalaghitso, pfipfila manabii wandika mbuli tsake. Ayo iyo Yesu wa Natsareti, imwana wa Yosefu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nasanaeli kaghutsa, “Apfi yodahika ichinu chochose chinoghile chilawile Natsareti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Filipi kamwidika, “Utse wone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu hamwonile Nasanaeli komtsila, kalonga, “Ayuno ka Muisiraeli ghendo, mghati mwake mduhu ughutsu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nasanaeli kamghutsa, “Angu unimanyiletse?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ng'ana Filipi yakukeme, tsanikwona haukalile hasi mwe mkuyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kuya Nasanaeli kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu! Ghweghwe kwa Imndewa wa Isiraeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Kwotoghola kwaapfila tsanikulongela nikwona kukala hasi he mkuyu? Kutsakwona makulu kubita agho.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kuya kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Nolongesa ghendo, mtsakona lilanga lyopfughuka ne wamalaika we Imulungu wogheluka na kuhulumka mchanya mwe Imwana we Imunu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ichihungo cha ukukwela ako Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya kadatu hambele, tsakukala ne ichihungo cha ukukwela ako Kana mne isi ya Galilaya. Na mai wake Yesu tsakabaho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake pfipfila tsawakemighwa mne ichihungo acho. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Idipfai haimalile, mai wake kamlongela, “Wahela idipfai.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mai, uleke kunongela cho kutenda isaa yangu ng'ana ipfike bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mai wake Yesu kawalongela iwatumwa, “Mtende chochose chowalongelani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Baho tsahana mabigha sita gha ghamatsi, ighekighwe kwaajili ye ichihendo cha Wayahudi cha ukwihopfugha. Chila bigha lyodaha kumema pfiya ishilini mbaka selasini. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwatumwa, “Mghamemetse ghamabigha ghamatsi.” Nawo waghamemetsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela, “Mdeghe, mmwing'e imkulu we ichihungo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nawo watenda ka pfawalongele, <verse number="9" style="v"/>nae imkulu we ichihungo kalanza ghamatsi ighaghaluke idipfai. Ng'amanyile bae kwailawile, lekeni iwatumwa iwadeghile ghamatsi tsawamanya. Kuya imkulu ayo kamkema imunu iyokwela hambalimbali, <verse number="10" style="v"/>kamlongela, “Chila imunu tanu kolapfa idipfai inoghile. Kuya wahenza hawomalitsa kunwa ng'ani, kolapfa idipfai ihile. Lekeni ghweghwe kuika idipfai inoghile mbaka sambi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu katenda chinu chino cha kukangawatsa cha mwanduso ako Kana, mne isi ya Galilaya. Ako kalangusa utunitso wake, ne iwanang'ina wake wamtoghola.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu na mai wake, hamwe na ndughu tsake ne iwanang'ina wake wahulumka Kaperinaumu. Wakala ako matsuwa chidogho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowawinga iwanu mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 12:12-13; Maliki 11:15-17; Luka 19:45-46)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ipasaka ya Wayahudi haikalile habehi, Yesu kagheluka Yerusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, Yesu kawapfika iwanu woutsa wang'ombe, iwang'olo ne iwanjiwa, ne iwanu wangi wakala hane tsimetsa wobena tsisendi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Imunu iyobena tsisendi</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kabota ichiboko che lutsabi, kawawinga iwanu wose mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, hamwe ne iwang'olo ne wang'ombe. Pfipfila katsibidula tsimetsa tse iwobena tsisendi na kutsipwililisa sendi tsawo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya kawalongela iwanu iwang'ali woutsa iwanjiwa, “Pfilapfeni hano pfinu pfino! Ule ing'anda ye Aba wangu mwoitenda ghulilo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wakumbuka ichandikighwe, “Imulungu, unoghelo wangu kwe ing'anda yako wakwaka mghati mwangu ka ghumoto.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya iwakulu wa Wayahudi wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi kwodaha kutenda chinu chachi cha kukangawatsa kutulangusa ka kuna uwetso wa ukutenda agha ghose?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Muimwaghe Ing'anda ino ye Imulungu, nene nitsoitsenga keli kwa ghamatsuwa madatu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamwidika, “Ing'anda ino ye Imulungu itsengighwa kwa miyaka alubaini na sita, naghwe utsoitsengatse kwa matsuwa madatu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni Ing'anda ye Imulungu iyang'ali yoilonga Yesu tsaikala ulukuli lwake. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apfo, hayatsilihuke, iwanang'ina wake wakumbuka achila chayalongile. Kuya waghatoghola Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka na watoghola mbuli tsila tsayalongile Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koimanya imimoyo ye iwanu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali Yerusalemu mne Ichihungo che Ipasaka, iwanu wangi wona pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayang'ali yotenda, wamtoghola. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu tsang'awatoghole bae, kwaapfila tsakawamanya iwanu wose. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amlongele mbuli tse iwanu, kwaapfila Yesu tsakamanya ighali mghati mwe imimoyo yawo.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tsakukala ne imkulu yumwe wa Mafarisayo, imunu we libalatsa lya Wayahudi iyakemighwe Nikodemu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Chilo chimwe, kamghendela Yesu, kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, twokumanya ghweghwe kwa mlangulitsi yulawile kwe Imulungu. Kwaapfila kuduhu imunu wowose iyodaha kutenda pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfautenda ka Imulungu ng'ali hamwe naye bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwona undewa we Imulungu ka ng'elekighwe lwa keli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nikodemu kamghutsa, “Apfi imunu imbala yodahatse kwelekighwa keli? Ng'aidahika ghendo imunu kwingila munda mwa mai wake na kwelekighwa keli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu ka ng'elekighwe bae kwa ghamatsi na kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imunu kakwelekighwa kwa lukuli kulawa kwa aba wake na mai wake, ila kakwelekighwa kwa muhe kulawa kwa Ghumuhe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Uleke kukangawala kwaapfila nokulongela wose mwobamighwa mwelekighwe keli. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Libeho lyoduma kokose kwalibama, kohulika litsi lyake. Lekeni ng'umanya bae kwalilawile kwani wala kwalighenda kwani. Apfi pfipfo pfaili kwa chila imunu yelekighwe na Ghumuhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nikodemu kamghutsa, “Angu ghano ghodahatse kulawila?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa mlangulitsi mkulu wa Waisiraeli, angu naghwe ng'utsimanyile bae mbuli tsino? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nokulongela ghendo, twolonga ipfinu pfatumanya na twowalongela ipfinu pfatwonile, lekeni mng'ali mwolema usenga wetu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ng'amtoghole bae haniwalongele mbuli tse ipfinu ipfili muisi, apfi mtsotogholatse ning'awalongela mbuli tse ipfinu ipfili kulanga?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyaghendile kulanga ila Imwana we Imunu, iyatsile kulawa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ka Musa pfayachinule ichinyagho chila che inzoka kwa lubiki kunyika, pfipfila Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yenulighwe, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ili chila imunu iyomtoghola awe ne ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu tsakainoghela isi yose mbaka kamlapfa Imwanaghe nyalimwe, ili chila imunu iyomtoghola aleke kwagha ila yawe na ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Imulungu ng'amtumile bae Imwanaghe muisi, yaihighe, ila yaikombole kubitila yeye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyomtoghola ng'atsohighighwa bae, lekeni imunu wowose iyolema kumtoghola ayo ma kahighighwa, kwaapfila ng'amtoghole bae Imwana nyalimwe we Imulungu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfi pfipfo pfamtsohighighwa, Ghumwanga ghutsa muisi, lekeni iwanu wanoghela ichisi kubita ghumwanga, kwaapfila ghawotenda gheha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwanu wose iwotenda ghehile woghuhila ghumwanga, ng'awakutsa bae mne ghumwanga, kwaapfila wopfuka aghala ghehile ghawotenda ghatsakoneka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni awala iwotenda ghanoghile wakutsa mne ghumwanga, ili aghala ghawotenda ghoneke mwatsi ka ghatendighwa kwa kumuhulikitsa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kolonga mbuli tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda mne isi ya Yudeya, ako kakala nawo, na tsakawabatitsa iwanu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pfipfila Yohane yang'ali yobatitsa Ainoni habehi ne Salemu, kwaapfila hanu aho tsahana ghamatsi mengi. Iwanu wang'ali womghendela, naye yang'ali yowabatitsa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa agho Yohane tsakakala ng'ana yohighwe mchifungo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wangi wa Yohane na Myahudi yumwe wang'ali weghutsaghutsa kwa mbuli ya ukuhopfugha ghamaghulu na ghamoko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Apfo wamghendela Yohane, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, imunu yula iyakalile naghwe kumwambu kwe tsiwa Yoridani, ayula yutulongele mbuli tsake, sambi kobatitsa na iwanu wose womghendela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohane kawedika, “Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kubokela ichinu ka ng'eng'ighwe bae ne Imulungu iyali kulanga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mwemwe iwenyegho mwa iwakalangama haniwalongele, ‘Nene si Kiristu Mkombotsi bae, ila nene nitumighwa nimlongole.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iyali na pinga iyokwelighwa, ayo iyo immale iyomkwela. Sale wake immale iyokwela kombeta na komtegheletsa, kodeng'elela hayohulika litsi lyake. Sambi ndeng'elo yangu itimila. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yeye kobamighwa awe mkulu, nene nobamighwa niwe mdodo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ayula iyolawila kulanga kamkulu kubita wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ayula iyolawila kulanga ka mkulu kubita wose. Imunu wa iisi kolawa muisi, na kolonga mbuli tse isi, ila iyolawila kulanga ka mkulu kubita wose. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yeye kolonga chayonile na chayahulike, lekeni kuduhu imunu iyotoghola mbuli tsalongile. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu wowose iyotoghola usenga wake, katsolonga Imulungu kolongesa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iyatumighwe ne Imulungu kolonga mbuli tse Imulungu, kwaapfila Imulungu kommemesa Ghumuhe ghwake Mwenzeluka. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aba komnoghela Imwanaghe na kagheka ghose mmoko mwake. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyomtoghola Imwana kakuwa ne ughima wa matsuwa ghose, lekeni imunu wowose iyomlema Imwana ng'atsakuwa ne ughima bae, ila katsokala mne maya ye Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga ne ipinga Msamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafarisayo tsawahulika ka Yesu yang'ali yowatenda iwanu wengi wawe iwanang'ina na kuwabatitsa kubita Yohane, <verse number="2" style="v"/>lekeni Yesu ng'abatitse bae iwanu, ila iwanang'ina wake iwo iwabatitse. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike apfi, kalawa Yudeya koya Galilaya, <verse number="4" style="v"/>mne ghumwanza ghwake tsakabamighwa kubitila Samariya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsakapfika Samariya hanu hakemighwe Sikari, habehi na mghunda ghula Yakobu ghwamwing'ile Yosefu, imwanaghe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Baho tsakukala na chisima cha Yakobu, kwaapfila Yesu tsakepfa kwa ghumwanza ghwake, apfo kakala hasi habehi ne chisima. Tsaikala nemisi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ipinga yumwe Msamariya tsakatsa kudegha ghamatsi, Yesu kamlongela, “Ungaye ghamatsi nuwe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake tsawaghenda mkaye kughula ichijo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa Myahudi, nene na Msamariya. Ule kwonomba ghamatsi?” Tsakalonga apfi kwaapfila Wayahudi na Wasamariya ng'awajagha hamwe bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ung'amanyile ichinu chayolapfa Imulungu na nani iyokulomba ghamatsi gho ukunwa, ung'amlombile, naye ang'akwing'ile ghamatsi ighoghala ughima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kalonga, “Imtwatsa, kwahela chinu cha kudeghela ghamatsi, ne chisima chighendesa. Lelo utsoghapata kwani ghamatsi ghe ughima? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfi ghweghwe kwa mbala kubita aba wetu Yakobu iyatwing'ile chisima chino, yeye mwenyegho ne iwanaghe ne iwanyama wake tsawanwa ghamatsi ghe chisima chino?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu wowose iyakunwa ghamatsi ghano, katsakona ng'ilu keli, <verse number="14" style="v"/>lekeni imunu wowose iyakunwa ghamatsi ghanimwing'a nene, ng'atsakona ng'ilu keli. Ghamatsi ghanimwing'a nene ghatsakuwa mbwibwi iilapfa ghamatsi gha ughima mghati mwake na ghatsomwing'a ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Mtwatsa ngaya ghamatsi agho ndeke kwona ng'ilu keli, kuya ndeke kutsa hano keli kudegha ghamatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda ukamkeme mmale wako, utse naye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Nahela mmale.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlongela, “Kolonga ghoya haulonga kwahela mmale. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsakukwelighwa ne iwamale watano, na mmale yauli naye sambi si mmale wako bae. Chaulongile kulongesa ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kalonga, “Imtwatsa, nakwona ghweghwe kwa nabii. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwabala wetu tsawamtamanila Imulungu hane lughongo luno, lekeni mwemwe Wayahudi mwolonga twobamighwa tumtamanile Imulungu ako Yerusalemu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Mai utoghole, ghamatsuwa ghakutsa iwanu ng'awatsomtamanila bae Aba hane lughongo luno wala ako Yerusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwemwe Wasamariya ng'amummanyile bae yamumtamanila, lekeni twetwe Wayahudi twommanya yatumtamanila, kwaapfila ukombotsi wolawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni matsuwa ghakutsa na sambi ghabaha iwanu iwotamanila kweli watsomtamanila Aba kwa kulongotsighwa na Ghumuhe na kweli, kwaapfila womtamanila ka Aba pfayobama. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imulungu ka Ghumuhe, apfo iwanu wake iwomtamanila wamtamanile kwa Ghumuhe na ukweli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamlongela, “Nomanya Masiya iyokemighwa Kiristu kakutsa, na hatsakutsa katsotulongela ghoya chila chinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nene yanilonga naghwe, iyo yuyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake Yesu tsawoya, wakangawala kumpfika Yesu kolonga ne ipinga ayo. Lekeni kuduhu imunu yamghutsile, “Apfi ubama choni?” au “Ule ulonga ne ipinga?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya ipinga ayo kachileka chiha chake cha ghamatsi, koya ukaye, kawalongela iwanu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mtse mmwone imunu iyanongele ipfinu pfose pfanendile. Apfi ayu kodaha kuwa Kiristu?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Apfo iwanu walawa mkaye mwao wamghendela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ichipindi chichila iwanang'ina wake wang'ali womlomba Yesu, “Mlangulitsi tanu diya!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawedika, “Nene nina ichijo ing'amchimanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wake wandusa kwighutsa, “Pfii hana munu iyamghalile chijo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ichijo changu chicho chino, kusang'ana aghala ghayobama iyanitumile na kuimalitsa ing'onde yangaile niisang'ane. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwolonga, ‘Ing'ali miyetsi mine, kuya ghamatsuwa gha mapfuno ghopfika.’ Nowalongela, mwinule tsinenge mlole imighunda! Ghamatsawo ghakomala, ghobamighwa ghapfunighwe! <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imunu iyopfuna kobokela maliho na kolunda hamwe ghamatsawo kwaajili ya ughima wa matsuwa ghose, ili imunu iyohanda na imunu iyopfuna wadeng'elele hamwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Iwanu hawolonga, ‘Yumwe kohanda, yungi kopfuna’ wolongesa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nimtumani kupfuna mne imighunda yang'amlimile bae, iwanu wangi wasang'ana namwe mwobweda kwa isang'ano yawo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wasamariya wengi womtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wasamariya wengi wa kaye ila wamtoghola Yesu kwa achila chalongile ipinga ayo, “Kanongela ipfinu pfose pfanendile.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Apfo Wasamariya wamghendela Yesu, wamlomba akale nawo, Yesu kakala nawo matsuwa meli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi tsawatoghola kwa mbuli tsa Yesu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wamlongela ipinga ayo, “Sambi tutoghola, si kwa achila chulongile bae, ila kwaapfila twetwe iwenyegho tumuhulika, twomanya imunu yuno kweli ka Mkombotsi we iisi yose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imwana we chilongotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Haghamalile matsuwa meli Yesu kaghenda Galilaya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yesu imwenyegho tsakalonga, “Nabii ng'otogholighwa bae mne isi yake.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu hapfikile Galilaya, iwanu wambokela kwaapfila nawo tsawaghenda mne Ichihungo cha Ipasaka ako Yerusalemu, na waghona ghose ghatendile Yesu mne ichihungo acho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kengila keli mne ghumji ghwa Kana ako Galilaya, hanu haghaluse ghamatsi kuwa idipfai. Baho tsakukala ne chilongotsi yane imwana iyoghula ako Kaperinaumu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Chilongotsi ayo hayahulike Yesu kapfika ako Galilaya kulawa Yudeya, kamghendela kamlomba aghende akamhonetse imwanaghe, iyang'ali habehi ukufa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Mwemwe ng'amtoghola mbaka mwone ipfitango na pfihulo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Chilongotsi ayo kamwidika, “Mtwatsa tuke ng'ana mwanangu yafe.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe ghenda, imwanagho katsohona.”</para>
  <para style="p">Chilongotsi ayo katoghola chalongile Yesu, koka ukaye. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Hang'ali mnzila, ketingana ne iwatumwa wake, wamlongela imwanaghe kahona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kawaghutsa, “Imwana handuse kuhona saa ngapi?” wamwidika, “Ligholo saa saba nemisi.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kuya aba ayo tsakamanya ka isaa iila Yesu yamlongele, “Imwanagho katsohona.” Apfo yeye na kaye yake wamtoghola Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Apfino tsapfikala pfihulo pfa keli pfatendile Yesu halawile Yudeya kughenda Galilaya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa chimbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hambele, Yesu kagheluka Yerusalemu kune ichihungo cha Wayahudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ako Yerusalemu, habehi na libani likulu ilikemighwe Libani lye Iwang'olo tsahana tsimbu ilikemighwe Betisada kwa Chihebulaniya, tsimbu alyo tsa lya habehi na pfibwalu pfitano. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi iwatamu tsawakala mne pfibwalu apfo, pfifita, pfimbete, ne iwanu iwaholole. Tsawang'ali wobeta ghamatsi ghatibuke, <verse number="4" style="v"/>kwaapfila malaika we Imtwatsa ang'ali yohulumkagha mne ghamatsi na kughatibula. Imtamu iyakwandusa kwingila mne ghamatsi ighatibulighwe, tsakahonetsighwa utamu wowose iyali nawo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe iyakalile hala, tsakakala mtamu kwa miyaka selasini na nane. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu hamwonile mtamu ayo kawasa hala, tsakamanya ka yang'ali yoghula kwa matsuwa mengi, apfo kamghutsa mtamu ayo, “Pfii kwobama uhone?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mtamu yula kamwidika, “Mtwatsa, nahela imunu wa kunyingitsa mne litsimbu ghamatsi haghotibulighwa. Hanibama kwingila, imunu yungi konongolela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Winuke! Sola chilagho chako uke.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bahala imunu yula kahona, kasola chilagho chake, koka.</para>
  <para style="p">Ichinu chino tsachilawila mne Litsuwa lye Sabato, <verse number="10" style="v"/>apfo Iwakulu wa Wayahudi wamlongela imunu yahonile, “Leloli Litsuwa lya Sabato, ghamalaghitso ghoghoma kuchighala chilagho chako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu ayo kawedika, “Imunu iyanihonetse kanongela, ‘Sola chilagho chako uke.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Angu munu wachi iyakulongele usole chilagho chako uke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'ammanyile bae imunu iyamuhonetse kwaapfila iwanu tsawengi na Yesu ma tsakoka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu kampfika imunu yula mne Ing'anda ya Ukulombela, kamlongela, “Tegheletsa, sambi kuhona. Uleke kutenda nzambi, ung'atenda nzambi, ichinu chihile chitsokulawila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuya imunu yula koka, kawalongela iwakulu wa Wayahudi ka yamuhonetse Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ughima kubitila Imwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yesu yang'ali yotenda ipfinu pfino mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, Wayahudi wandusa kumhila. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Aba wangu kosang'ana ghamatsuwa ghose, na nene pfipfila nobamighwa nisang'ane.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apfo Wayahudi wabama wamkome Yesu. Tsawabama wamkome Yesu si kwaapfila kalibetsa Litsuwa lya Sabato liliheka, ila tsakamkema Imulungu Aba wake, apfo ketenda keghala ne Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu we Imwana wa Imunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ghendo, Imwana ng'odaha bae kutenda chinu chochose yaliyeka, Imwana kodaha kutenda aghala ghomwona Aba wake koghatenda, kwaapfila ghoghose ghotenda Aba, Imwana naye koghatenda. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Aba komnoghela Imwana na komlangusa ghose ghayotenda. Kuya katsomlangusa ipfinu pfikulu pfa kusang'ana kubita pfino, namwe mtsokangawala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ka Aba pfayowatsilihula iwanu iwafile na kuweng'a ughima, pfipfila Imwana kolapfa ughima kwe iwanu iyowabama. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aba ng'omuhigha bae imunu wowose, lekeni kamwing'a Imwanaghe uwetso wa kuhigha, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ili iwanu wose wamuhulikitse Imwana ka pfawomuhulikitsa Aba. Imunu wowose iyolema kumuhulikitsa Imwana komlema Aba iyamtumile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyohulika mbuli yangu na kumtoghola ayula iyanitumile kana ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, ng'atsohighighwa kwaapfila kaloka lifwa kengila mne ughima. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, litsuwa lyakutsa na sambi ma lipfika iwanu iwafile hawatsohulika litsi lye Imwana we Imulungu, na awala iwahulike watsakuwa waghima. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ka Aba imwenyegho pfayali mwanduso we ighima, pfipfila kamtenda Imwanaghe kuwa mwanduso we ughima. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kamwing'a imwana uwetso wa kuhigha, kwaapfila ka Imwana we Imunu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mleke kukangawala mbuli ino, litsuwa lyakutsa iwanu iwafile hawatsohulika litsi lyake, <verse number="29" style="v"/>watsolawa mne tsikabuli tsawo, awala iwatendile ghanoghile watsotsilihulighwa wawe waghima, na iwatendile ghehile watsotsilihulighwa wahighighwe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nene sidaha bae kutenda ichinu imwenyegho, nohigha ka Imulungu pfonongela, nohigha kwa haki, kwaapfila sitenda bae chanibama, ila notenda achila chobama ayula iyanitumile.</para>
  <para style="s">Wakalangama wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Ning'alonga mbuli tsangu imwenyegho, ukalangama wangu wa ughutsu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lekeni kuna yungi iyolonga mbuli tsangu, nomanya chila chinu chalongile kalongesa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mwemwe tsamuwatuma iwanu kwa Yohane, na mbuli tsangu tsalongile tsolongesa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Sibama bae ukalangama we imunu, ila nolonga apfi ili mwemwe mkombolighwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohane tsakakala ka ichitasa, iching'ali chikwaka na chomwemwesa, namwe msaghula ghamatsuwa chidogho kudeng'elela ghumwanga ghwake. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nina ukalangama mkulu kubita wa Yohane. Kwaapfila ing'onde iyangaile Aba niimalitsa, isang'ano yanisang'ana, yolangusa Aba kanituma. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Aba imwenyegho iyanitumile kalonga mbuli tsangu. Ng'amuhulike bae litsi lyake wala kuchona chihanga chake, <verse number="38" style="v"/>na mbuli yake ng'aikala bae mghati mwenu, kwaapfila ng'amumtoghole yula iyamtumile. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mwosoma Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, kwaapfila mwopfikitsa mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka mtsopata ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. Ghamaandiko ghagho Mahenzeluka gholonga mbuli tsangu! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lekeni mng'ali mwolema kunitsila muwe na ughima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Sibama bae iwanu wanitunye. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lekeni nommanyani ka mwahela unoghelo we Imulungu mne imimoyo yenu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nitsa kwa taghwa lya Aba wangu, ng'amnitoghole bae, lekeni imunu yungi ang'atsa kwa taghwa lyake, mtsombokela. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Apfi mtsodahatse kunitoghola, ka mwemwe mwobama kubokela utunitso kulawa kuna mwemwe iwenyegho, lekeni mwolema kubokela utunitso iulawa kwe Imulungu yaliyeka? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mleke kupfikitsa nitsowalongeletsa kwa Aba. Musa iyammwikile lolelo lyenu, ayo yuyo iyatsomuhighani. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mng'amtoghole Musa, mng'anitoghole na nene, kwaapfila tsakandika mbuli tsangu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lekeni ka ng'amchitoghola achila chandikile, apfi mtsotogholatse chanilonga?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:13-21; Maliki 6:30-44; Luka 9:10-17)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu kaloka kumwambu mwa tsimbu Galilaya au tsimbu Tiberiya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Likingili lye iwanu limuwinza Yesu kwaapfila tsawona pfihulo pfayatendile pfa kuwahonetsa iwatamu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wagheluka mchidunda, wakala hasi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ichihungo che Ipasaka ya Wayahudi tsachikala chahabehi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu hayalolile mmbalimbali kona mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu womtsila, kamghutsa Filipi, “Kwani twodaha kughula ichijo tuweng'e iwanu wano waje?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kaghutsa pfino kumghetsa Filipi, kwaapfila tsakamanya katsotenda choni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filipi kamwidika, “Sendi miya mbili ng'atsidaha bae kumghulila chighate chila imunu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imwanang'ina yungi wa Yesu, Andereya, ndughu yake Simoni Petiri, kamlongela Yesu, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hano hana imsongolo yumwe, yane ipfihindi pfitano pfe pfighate ne iwasomba weli. Lekeni watsoghutatse kwe ipfijo pfino chidogho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Muwalongele iwanu wakale hasi.” Hanu hala tsahana imitsani, iwanu wakala hasi, tsakukala ne iwamale elufu tano. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kasola ipfihande pfe pfighate, kalonga, “Mighede Imulungu,” kaweng'a iwanu iwakalile hasi. Katenda pfipfo kwa iwasomba ka iwanu pfawabamile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iwanu wose hawaghutile, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Mdondole ipfihande ipfikalile. Chochose chileke ukwagha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo iwanang'ina wadondola, wamemesa ipfiseghe kumi na pfili pfe ipfihande pfe pfighate ipfikalile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwanu hawonile pfihulo ipfitendighwe na Yesu, wandusa kulonga, “Kweli ayuno ka nabii iyakutsa muisi.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya iwanu wambama ghendo wamtende yawe imndewa, apfo kagheluka keli mchidunda yaliyeka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 14:22-23; Maliki 6:45-52)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Litsua haliswele, iwanang'ina wake Yesu wahulumka mbaka mne tsimbu, <verse number="17" style="v"/>wadina mnumbwi waloka tsimbu waghenda Kaperinaumu. Tsakukala ne ichisi, na Yesu tsakakala ng'ana yawapfikile bae. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Libeho kulu ling'ali lyoduma na ghamatsi ghatibuka. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina hawaghendile utali we maili ndatu au maili nne, tsawamwona Yesu koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi, kakutsa habehi na mnumbwi, iwanang'ina wapfuka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Na nene, mleke kupfuka!” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuya wabama wamsole Yesu mne mnumbwi, bahala mnumbwi tsaghupfika hanu hawabamile kupfika.</para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wombama Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya keli kingili lye iwanu ilikalile kumwambu mwe tsimbu wamanya kukala na mnumbwi umwe uliyeka, Yesu ng'engile bae mne mnumbwi ne iwanang'ina wake, ila iwanang'ina tsawoka waliyeka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kuya iminumbwi mingi ilawile Tiberiya tsaipfika habehi ne hanu iwanu hawajile pfighate Imtwatsa hayamalitse kupfibaliki. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iwanu hawamanyile Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake ng'awalibaho bae hanu hala, wengila mne iminumbwi waghenda Kaperinaumu kumbama.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ichijo che Ughima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanu hawamwonile Yesu ubali ungi we tsimbu, wamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, apfi hano upfikile tsuwachi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongelani ghendo, mwonibama kwaapfila mja pfighate mghuta, si kwaapfila mwona pfihulo pfangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mleke kuchisulukila ichijo ichikola, mchisulukile ichijo ichikala ghamatsuwa ghose. Ichijo chino chicho Imwana we Imunu yatsomwing'ani, kwaapfila Imulungu, Aba kamsaghula na kamtoghola.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya wamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi tutende choni ili tughatende aghala ghobama Imulungu tughatende?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Achino ichinu chayobama Imulungu mtende, mumtoghole ayula iyamtumile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Apfo wamghutsa, “Angu pfihulo pfachi pfausang'ana ili tupfone tukutoghole? Kutsotenda choni? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iwabala wetu waja mana kunyika, ka pfayandikighwe mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, ‘Kaweng'a chighate ichihulumke kulanga waje.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, si Musa bae iyaweng'ile chighate ichihulumke kulanga, ila Aba wangu iyo iyaweng'ile chighate che ukweli kulawa kulanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwaapfila chighate chayotwing'a Imulungu iyo ayula iyakutsa kulawa kulanga na iyolapfa ughima kwe iwanu iwali muisi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wamlongela, “Imtwatsa, utwing'e chighate chino ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Nene na ichijo ichighala ughima, awala iwakutsa kuna nene ng'awatsokwona nzala bae, na awala iwonitoghola ng'awatsakwona ng'ilu bae. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ka pfaniwalongele, mmbona lekeni mng'ali ng'amnitoghola bae. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wose iyongaya Aba watsakutsa kuna nene, imunu wowose iyonitsila, simuwinga bae. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nihulumka kulawa kulanga si kutenda pfanibama bae, ila kutenda pfayobama ayula iyanitumile. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ayula iyanitumile kobama apfi, ndeke kumwaghitsa imunu wowose mna iwanu wala iyangaile, ila niwatsilihule wose mna litsuwa lya usighilo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Aba wangu kobama chila imunu iyomlola Imwana na kumtoghola yawe na ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. Nitsomtsilihula litsuwa lya usighilo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wayahudi wandusa kumnung'unikila Yesu kwaapfila tsakalonga, “Nene na chighate ichihulumke kulawa kulanga.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walonga, “Apfi ayu si Yesu bae imwana wa Yosefu, aba wake ne mai wake twowamanya. Lelo kodahatse kulonga, ‘Nihulumka kulawa kulanga?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kunung'unika. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kunitsila ka Aba iyanitumile ng'amkweghile bae, na nene nitsomtsilihula litsuwa lya usighilo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wanabii tsawandika, ‘Iwanu wose watsolangulitsighwa ne Imulungu.’ Chila imunu iyomtegheletsa Aba na kwilangulitsa kuna yeye katsokutsa kuna nene. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Chanilonga chicho chino, kuduhu imunu iyamwonile Aba ila yula iyalawile kwe Imulungu, ayo yuyo yaliyeka iyamwonile Aba. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyotoghola kana ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nene na chijo ichighala ughima. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Iwabala wenu tsawaja mana kunyika lekeni wafa. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lekeni achino ichighate ichihulumka kulawa kulanga, imunu iyochija ng'atsokufa bae. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nene na ichijo che ughima ichihulumke kulawa kulanga. Imunu ang'aja chijo chino, katsokala ghamatsuwa ghose. Chijo chino lukuli lwangu, nolulapfa ili iwanu we isi yose wawe ne ughima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kuya Wayahudi wandusa kwighutsa kwa maya, “Apfi imunu yuno kodahatse kutwing'a lukuli lwake tuluje?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, ka ng'amkuja lukuli lwe Imwana we Imunu na kunwa idamu yake, ng'amtsokuwa ne ughima mghati mwenu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyoluja lukuli lwangu na kunwa idamu yangu kana ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, nitsomtsilihula mne litsuwa lya usighilo. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kwaapfila lukuli lwangu ichijo cha kweli na idamu yangu chokunwa cha kweli. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyoluja lukuli lwangu na kunwa idamu yangu, ayo kokala mghati mwangu, na nene nokala mghati mwake. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Aba iyali mghima kanituma, na kwaajili ya Aba nene nokala, apfo imunu iyoluja lukuli lwangu katsokala kwaajili ya nene. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Achino chicho ichijo ichihulumke kulawa kulanga, si ka mana iwajile iwabala wenu, na ukufa. Lekeni imunu iyakuja chijo chino katsokuwa mghima ghamatsuwa ghose.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesu kaghalonga agho hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye ukulombela ako Kaperinaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tse Ghamatsuwa Ghose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi iwamuwinzile Yesu hawahulike apfo, walonga, “Ghamalangulitso ghano makomu. Apfi yuhi iyodaha kughatoghola?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyamlongele Yesu ichinu chawang'ali wonung'unika iwanang'ina wake, lekeni yeye tsakamanya, apfo kawaghutsa, “Ule ghamalangulitso ghano ghoghetsa ukutoghola kwenu? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Itsakuwatse ka mtsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakuya kulanga hanu hayakalile mwanduso? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Ghumuhe we Imulungu kolapfa ughima, ngupfu tsa imunu ng'atsidaha chinu. Mbuli tsaniwalongele tsowaghalila muhe na ughima. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Hata apfo, wangi wenu mng'ali ng'amtoghola.” Kwaapfila Yesu tsakamanya kulawa mwanduso tsina nani ing'awotoghola na tsakamanya nani iyatsomhunduka. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalonga keli, “Kwaajili ayo tsaniwalongela kuduhu imunu iyodaha kunitsila mbaka Aba yamtoghole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kulawa litsuwa lino iwanang'ina wake wengi woya kuchughu, ng'awamuwinzile keli. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, “Pfii, namwe pfipfila mwobama kuka?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, tughende kwa nani? Ghweghwe kuna mbuli itsighala ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Twotoghola na twomanya ghweghwe kwa Mwenzeluka we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawedika, “Apfi siwasaghuleni mwemwe kumi na weli bae? Lekeni yumwe wenu ka Setani.” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Yesu tsayang'ali yolonga mbuli tsa Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Isikarioti, yumwe we iwanang'ina wala kumi na weli, iyomhunduka Yesu hambele.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwandughu tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hambele, Yesu kaghenda Galilaya, ng'abamile bae kughenda Yudeya, kwaapfila iwakulu we Wayahudi tsawabama wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lekeni chihungo cha Wayahudi cha Ipfibumbulika haching'ali habehi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ndughu tsake Yesu wamlongela, “Ulawe hano ughende Yudeya, ili iwanang'ina wako wone pfihulo pfausang'ana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyofisa aghala ghayotenda ka kobama yamanyike ne iwanu wangi. Kwaapfila ghweghwe kwotenda ipfinu pfino, wilanguse kwe iwanu we iisi yose.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mana hata iwandughu tsake ng'awamtoghole.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Litsuwa lyangu linoghile ng'ana lipfike bae, ila kuna mwemwe chila litsuwa linogha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Iwanu we isi ng'awodaha kuwahilani mwemwe, ila wonihila nene kwaapfila nolonga ka aghala ghawotenda gheha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mghende mne Ichihungo. Nene sighenda bae mne Ichihungo acho, kwaapfila litsuwa lyangu ng'ana lipfike bae.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tsakalonga apfi, kuya kakala ako Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mne Ichihungo che Ipfibumbulika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwandughu tsake hawaghendile mne ichihungo, naye Yesu pfipfila kaghenda, lekeni ng'aghendile bae mwatsimwatsi, ila kaghenda chinyelenyele. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mne ichihungo acho, iwakulu we Wayahudi wang'ali wombama Yesu, waghutsa, “Apfi yalikwani imunu yula?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mne likingili, iwanu wang'ali wenong'onetsa mbuli tsa Yesu. Iwanu wangi walonga, “Imunu yuno kanogha.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wangi wedika, “Mbe, kowaghitsa iwanu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni kuduhu imunu iyadahile kulonga mbuli yoyose ya Yesu mwatsimwatsi, kwaapfila wawapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa mne Ichihungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ichihungo haching'ali habehi kumala Yesu kaghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kandusa kulangulitsa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwakulu we Wayahudi wakangawala, walonga, “Apfi imunu yuno aghapatiletse ghamalangulitso ghano, naye ng'asomile bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ghamalangulitso ghanilangulitsa si ghangu bae, ila gholawa kwa yula iyanitumile. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'asaghula kutenda pfayobama Imulungu, katsomanya ka ghamalangulitso ghangu gholawa kwe Imulungu au nolonga kwa uwetso wangu imwenyegho. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imunu iyolonga mbuli tsake kobama utunitso wake, lekeni imunu iyobama utunitso kwa yula iyamtumile ayo mwenyepfale, kuduhu ughutsu mna yeye. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfi Musa ng'aweng'ile bae Ghamalaghitso? Lekeni kuduhu imunu iyokinda Ghamalaghitso mna mwemwe. Ebali mwobama mng'ome?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Likingili lye iwanu limwidika, “Ghweghwe kuna chinyamkela. Yuhi iyobama yakukome?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Tsanenda chihulo chimwe, namwe wose mkangawala. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musa tsakamlaghitseni muwengitse ngoma iwanenu, hata ka si Musa bae ila iwabala wenu iwanduse ichinu acho, namwe mwomwingitsa ngoma imwana Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ka mwomwingitsa ngoma imwana Litsuwa lya Sabato ili kukindilisa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, ebali mwakwona maya kwaapfila nimhonetsa imunu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mleke kuhigha kwa kulola kuliheka, ila muhighe kwa haki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Apfi ayu ka Yesu Kiristu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wa Yerusalemu wandusa kwighutsa, “Apfi si imunu yuno bae iwombama wamkome? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lola hayuno! Kolonga mwatsimwatsi na iwanu ng'awomlongela ichinu bae. Pfii iwakulu wetu womanya ghendo ayu ka Kiristu? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kiristu hayatsakutsa kuduhu imunu iyatsomanya kolawila kwani, lekeni twetwe twomanya koyolawila imunu yuno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kalonga kwa kukemelela, “Ona, mwonimanya na mwomanya kwonilawila. Sitsile bae kwa kubama imwenyegho, lekeni iyanitumile ka ukweli. Mwemwe ng'amummanyile bae, <verse number="29" style="v"/>lekeni nene nommanya kwaapfila nolawila kuna yeye, naye kanituma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kuya wabama kumghogha, lekeni kuduhu imunu iyagholose ghamoko ghake kumghogha, kwaapfila litsuwa lyake tsang'ana lipfike. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wengi kulawa mne likingili wamtoghola walonga, “Kiristu hayatsakutsa, apfi katsotenda pfihulo pfingi kubita imunu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwalolesi wotumighwa kumghogha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wahulika iwanu wonong'ona mbuli tsa Yesu. Apfo iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo wawatuma iwabetetsi we Ing'anda ye Imulungu kumghogha Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nokala namwe kwa matsuwa chidogho, kuya nitsoghenda kwa ayula iyanitumile. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mtsombama, lekeni ng'amtsombona bae, kwaapfila ng'amdaha bae kutsa hanu hanili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wayahudi welongela, “Apfi imunu yuno katsoghenda kwani mbaka tuleke kumwona? Pfii katsoghenda mne kaye tsa Wagiriki iwokala iwanu wetu na kuwalangulitsa Wagiriki? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Apfi kana mana yachi hayalongile ‘Mtsonibama, lekeni ng'amtsombona’ na ‘ng'amdaha bae kutsa hanu hanili’?”</para>
  <para style="s">Ghumto ighulapfa ghamatsi ghe Ughima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Litsuwa lya usighilo na litsuwa kulu lya ichihungo, Yesu kema, kakemelela, “Imunu wowose yane ng'ilu, yatse kuna nene yanwe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene, ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga, ‘Imito ye ghamatsi iighala ughima itsokwitika kulawa mghati mwake.’ ” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu tsayang'ali yolonga mbuli tse Ghumuhe, yawatsombokela iwanu awala iwomtoghola. Mbaka litsuwa lila iwanu tsawang'ali ng'aweng'ighwe bae Ghumuhe, kwaapfila Yesu tsakakala ng'ana yatunitsighwe ne Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwighola kwe iwanu kwaajili ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hawahulike mbuli tsake, iwanu wangi walonga, “Kweli imunu yuno ka ayula Nabii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi walonga, “Ayuno ka Kiristu Mkombotsi.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni iwanu wangi wang'ali weghutsa, “Apfi Kiristu kodahatse kulawa Galilaya? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Apfi Ghamaandiko Maenzeluka ng'aghalongile bae Kiristu katsolawila mlukolo lwa imndewa Daudi na kwelekighwa Betilehemu, kaye yakalile Daudi?” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Apfo iwanu tsawebaghula kwaajili ya Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Iwanu wangi wabama kumghogha, lekeni kuduhu imunu iyamgholosele ghumoko.</para>
  <para style="s">Iwakulu wa Wayahudi wolema kumtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wakalitsi we Ing'anda ye Imulungu hawoyile, iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo wawaghutsa, “Ule ng'amtsile naye bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wakalitsi wawedika, “Kuduhu imunu yadahile kulonga ka imunu yuno!” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wawaghutsa, “Pfii namwe pfipfila kawabugha?” <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Angu kuna imkulu au Mfarisayo iyamtoghole? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bali iwanu wano ng'awomanya bae Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, apfo walighitighwa ne Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nikodemu, Mfarisayo yumwe, iyamghendele Yesu aho mwanduso, kawalongela, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Apfi Ghamalaghitso ghetu ghomhigha imunu wowose ka ng'atumhulikitse na kumanya chayatendile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Pfii naghwe kwolawa Galilaya? Lola Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, kutsomanya ka kuduhu nabii iyolawila Galilaya.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kuya chila imunu koka ukaye yake.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ipinga iyaghoghighwe ughoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kaghenda kune chidunda che Mitseituni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo litsuwa lya keli Yesu kaghenda keli mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Iwanu wose wamtsunguluka, naye kakala hasi, kandusa kuwalangulitsa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iwalangulitsi wa Ghamalangulitso na Mafarisayo wamghala ipinga iyaghoghighwe ughoni. Wamwika ipinga ayo hambele hawo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, ipinga yuno kaghoghighwa ughoni. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mne Ghamalaghitso, Musa katulaghitsa apfi, ipinga ka ayu kobamighwa yatowighwe na ghamabwe mbaka yafe. Lelo ghweghwe ulongatse?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tsawaghutsa pfino wamwonze Yesu ili wapate ghomba lya kumghoghela. Lekeni Yesu kenamila hasi, kandusa kwandika hasi kwa chidole chake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hawaghendelele kumghutsa, Yesu kenuka kawalongela, “Imunu wowose mna mwemwe iyalihela nzambi, yalongole kumwasila libwe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kenama keli, kandika hasi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwanu wala hawahulike apfi, wandusa kuka yumweyumwe, wandusa iwabala. Yesu kasighala ne ipinga ayula yemile hala. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kenuka kamghutsa, “Walikwani iwanu iwakughoghile? Pfii kuduhu imunu iyakuhighile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, kuduhu imunu iyanihighile.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlongela, “Na nene sikuhigha bae. Ghenda na uleke kutenda keli nzambi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ghumwanga ghwe iisi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hayalongile keli ne iwanu, kalonga, “Nene na ghumwanga ghwe iisi. Imunu wowose iyoniwinza ng'atsokwanga mchisi bae, ila katsokuwa na ghumwanga ghwe ughima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwelapfila imwenyegho ukalangama, na ukalangama wako wa ughutsu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hata ning'elapfila ukalangama imwenyegho, ukalangama wangu wolongesa, kwaapfila nomanya kwani kwanilawila na kwani konighenda. Lekeni mwemwe ng'ammanyile bae kwani kwanilawila au kwanighenda. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwohigha ka iwanu pfawohigha. Nene simuhigha imunu bae. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni ka nohigha, nohigha ghoya, kwaapfila sisang'ana bae niliyeka, Aba iyanitumile kahamwe na nene. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yandikighwa mne Ghamalaghitso ghenu ukalangama we iwanu weli wotogholighwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nene nelapfila imwenyegho ukalangama, na mkalangama wangu yungi, Aba iyanitumile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kuya wamghutsa, “Aba wako yalikwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Ng'amnimanyile nene wala ng'amummanyile Aba wangu, mng'animanyile, pfipfila mng'ammanyile Aba wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga mbuli tsino hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, hanu hane chinu cha kwikila sadaka. Kuya kuduhu imunu iyamghoghile kwaapfila chipindi chake tsa ng'ana chipfike bae.</para>
  <para style="s">Ng'amdaha bae kughenda kwanighenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga nawo keli, “Nakuka, mtsombama lekeni mtsakufa mne nzambi tsenu. Ng'amdaha bae kutsa hanu hanighenda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwakulu wa Wayahudi waghutsa, “Kolonga ng'atudaha bae kughenda hanu hoyoghenda. Pfii kobama yekome imwenyegho?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lekeni Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mwa wa iisi ino ili hasi, lekeni nene na wa kulanga. Mwemwe mwa iwanu wa muisi amu, lekeni nene si wa muisi amu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tsaniwalongela mtsakufa mne nzambi tsenu. Kwaapfila ng'amtoghola bae ‘Nene na Yuyula’ mtsakufa mne nzambi tsenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wamghutsa Yesu, “Lelo ghweghwe uli nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Nene na Yuyula kulawa mwanduso.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nina mbuli nyingi tsa kulonga mna mwemwe na kuwahigha. Lekeni iyanitumile yeye kotogholighwa, na chanihulike kuna yeye, chicho chaniwalongela iwanu wose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ng'awamanyile bae ka Yesu yang'ali yowalongela mbuli tse Aba wake. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamtsomwinula Imwana we Imunu mna msalaba, mtsomanya nene na Yuyula, kuya mtsomanya ka nene sitenda ichinu chochose niliyeka, ila nolonga chayanilangulitse Aba wangu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yula iyanitumile kahamwe na nene, ng'anilekile niliyeka bae, kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghose notenda ighomnoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi iwamhulikitse Yesu hayang'ali yolonga pfinu pfino wamtoghola.</para>
  <para style="s">Imwana we Imulungu katsomkombolani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela awala Wayahudi iwamtoghole, “Mng'aghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu, mwemwe mtsakuwa iwanang'ina wangu ghendo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kuya mtsomanya ukweli, na ukweli utsowakombola.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wamwidika Yesu, “Twetwe twa watsukulu wa Abrahamu, ng'atuwile bae iwatumwa we imunu wowose. Pfii kuya kwolonga tutsokombolighwa?” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyotenda nzambi ka imtumwa wa nzambi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imtumwa ng'okala bae ukaye ghamatsuwa ghose, ila imwana kokala ukaye ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imwana ang'amkombolani, mtsokombolighwa ghendo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nomanya mwemwe mwa watsukulu we Abrahamu. Lekeni mwobama mnikome kwaapfila ng'amtoghola ghamalangulitso ghangu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nowalongela achila Aba wangu chayanilanguse, lekeni mwemwe mwotenda achila chayawalongele aba wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Aba wetu Abrahamu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawedika, “Mng'awile iwana we Abrahamu, mng'atendile aghala ghayatendile Abrahamu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Niwalongela ukweli yaniuhulike kwe Imulungu. Lekeni mwemwe mng'ali mwobama mnikome. Abrahamu ng'atendile pfino bae! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwotenda ipfinu ipfitendighwe na aba wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Imulungu yaliyeka iyo Aba wetu yatulinaye. Twetwe twa iwanaghe ghendo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Setani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ka Imulungu ang'awile Aba wenu, mng'amnoghele, kwaapfila ndawa kwe Imulungu na sambi nahano. Sitsile bae kwa uwetso wangu imwenyegho, ila yeye kanituma. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ebali ng'amchimanya bae chanilonga? Kwaapfila mwemwe ng'amdaha bae kuhulikitsa chanilonga. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mwolawa kwa aba wenu Yehile, na mwotenda ka aba wenu pfayobama. Kulawa mwanduso tsakawakoma iwanu, kwaapfila kuduhu ukweli kuna yeye. Hayolonga ughutsu, kolonga chihendo chake, kwaapfila ka mghutsu na aba we ughutsu. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Na nene kwaapfila nolongesa, ng'amnitoghola bae. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Apfi mna mwemwe kuna imunu iyodaha kulapfa ukalangama ka nene nina nzambi? Ka nolongesa, ebali ng'amnitoghola bae? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Imunu we Imulungu kohulikitsa mbuli tse Imulungu. Mwemwe ng'amuhulikitsa kwaapfila mwemwe si iwanu we Imulungu bae.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamligha Yesu kwa kumghutsa, “Apfi ng'atulongile ghoya bae ka ghweghwe kwa Msamariya na kuna chinyamkela?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nene nahela chinyamkela, nene nomuhulikitsa Aba wangu lekeni mwemwe ng'amnihulikitsa bae. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nene sibamila utunitso imwenyegho bae, ila kabaho iyoubama, ayo ka mlamutsi. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyokinda ghamalaghitso ghangu ng'atsokufa bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamlongela Yesu, “Sambi twomanya kuna chinyamkela! Abrahamu na manabii wafa, lekeni ghweghwe kwolonga imunu wowose iyokinda ghamalangulitso ghako ng'atsakufa bae. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Angu ghweghwe kwa mbala kubita aba wetu Abrahamu iyafile? Pfipfila manabii nawo wafa. Apfi ghweghwe kwolonga uli nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ning'etunya imwenyegho, utunitso wangu si chinu. Aba wangu yamumkema Imulungu wenu, yeye iyo yonitunya. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Mwemwe ng'amummanya bae, lekeni nene nommanya. Ning'alonga simmanyile bae, nitsakuwa mghutsu ka mwemwe. Lekeni nommanya na nokinda imbuli yake. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Aba wenu Abrahamu kadeng'elela kwaajili ya kulyona litsuwa lya kutsa kwangu, naye kalyona, kalideng'elela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamlongela Yesu, “Ghweghwe ng'una upfike imiyaka hamsini, naghwe kumwona Abrahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ghendo, Abrahamu ng'ana yelekighwe nene nabaho.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kuya wadondola ghamabwe wabama wamtowe Yesu, lekeni Yesu kalawa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyelekighwe chifita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda mmbalimbali, kamwona imunu chifita kulawa kwelekighwa kwake. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, yuhi iyatendile nzambi, mbaka imunu yuno yelekighwe chifita, imunu yuno au iwamweleke?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Si imunu yuno wala iwamweleke bae iwatendile nzambi, lekeni ilawila pfino ili ngupfu ye Imulungu yoneke mne ughima wake. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kung'ali misi, twobamighwa kusang'ana ing'onde ya ayula iyanitumile. Chilo hachikutsa kuduhu imunu iyodaha kusang'ana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Haning'ali muisi, nene na ghumwanga ghwe isi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hayamalitse kulonga apfi, kabwalula ghamate mne lidongo, kapfulugha likododo kwa ghamate kambaka chifita mnenge. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda ukahopfughe chihanga chako mne tsimbu Siloamu.” Siloamu mana yake “Iyatumighwe.” Apfo imunu yula koka kaghenda kuhopfugha chihanga chake, kuya koka ukaye aku kakona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu iwang'ali wokala naye habehi ne iwanu iwamwonile hayang'ali yolomba weghutsa, “Apfi ayu si imunu yula iyang'ali yolomba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwenga walonga, “Ayuno yeye,” lekeni wangi walonga, “Ayu si yeye bae, keghala naye.” Lekeni imunu yula kalonga, “Nene na yuyula iyaning'ali nilomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Apfi kudahatse kona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kawedika, “Imunu iwomkema Yesu kapfulugha likododo kanibaka mnenge mwangu. Kanongela ng'ende Siloamu nikahopfughe chihanga changu. Apfo ng'enda, bahala haning'ali nohupfugha chihanga, nidaha kwona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Alikwani imunu hayo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Kawedika, “Imane.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mafarisayo womghutsa imunu yahonetsighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuya iwanu wamghala imunu yula yakalile chifita kwa Mafarisayo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Litsuwa Yesu lyapfulughe likododo na kumhonetsa imunu chifita tsalikala Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kuya Mafarisayo wamghutsa keli imunu ayo pfayadahile kona. Kawedika, “Kanibaka likododo mnenge mwangu, nihopfugha chihanga changu, sambi nakona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wamwenga walonga, “Imunu yuno yatendile pfino ng'olawa bae kwe Imulungu, kwaapfila kolibetsa Litsuwa lya Sabato.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni iwanu wangi waghutsa, “Apfi imunu yane nzambi kodahatse kutenda pfihulo ka pfino?” Apfo weghola. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya Mafarisayo wamghutsa imunu ayo, “Kulonga kakuhonetsa tsinenge tsako. Ghweghwe ulongatse kwa imunu ayo?” Naye kawedika, “Imunu ayo ka nabii.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya iwakulu wa Wayahudi ng'awatoghole bae ka imunu ayo tsachifita na kadaha kona, mbaka wawakema aba na mai we imunu hayo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wayahudi wawaghutsa, “Apfi ayu mwanenu? Yumlonga kelekighwa chifita, lelo kodahatse ukona?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Aba wake na mai wake wawedika, “Twomanya ayu mwanetu, twomanya tsakelekighwa chifita. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'atumanyile bae pfayadahile kona na ng'atummanyile imunu iyamhonetse nenge tsake. Mumghutse, yeye ka imbala kodaha kwidika imwenyegho!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aba wake na mai wake walonga apfi kwaapfila wang'ali wowapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi, kwaapfila tsawalonga imunu wowose iyolonga Yesu ka Kiristu katsowingighwa mne Ing'anda ye Kulombela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kwaajili ayo aba na mai wake tsawalonga apfi, “Imwenyegho ka imbala, mghutseni.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamkema keli imunu ayo, wamlongela, “Wilahe kwe Imulungu ka kolongesa! Twomanya imunu iyakuhonetse kana nzambi.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kawedika, “Imane ka imunu ayu kana nzambi au kahela nzambi. Ichinu chimwe chanimanya; tsang'ala chifita lekeni sambi nakona!” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kuya wamghutsa imunu ayo, “Angu akutendele choni? Yatendiletse kukuhonetsa tsinenge tsako?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kawedika, “Tsaniwalongela lekeni ng'ambamile bae kutegheletsa. Ule mwobama kuhulika imbuli ino keli? Pfii namwe mwobama kuwa iwanang'ina wake?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kuya wamligha wamlongela, “Ghweghwe kwa mwanang'ina wake! Twetwe twa iwanang'ina wa Musa! <verse number="29" style="v"/>Twomanya Imulungu tsakalonga na Musa, lekeni imunu yuno, ng'atumanyile bae kolawila kwani!” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Imunu yula kawedika, “Mwonikangawatsa! Mwemwe ng'ammanyile kwani koyolawila, lekeni katsihonetsa nenge tsangu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Twomanya Imulungu ng'omhulikitsa bae imunu yane nzambi. Imulungu komhulikitsa imunu iyomtoghola na iyotenda chayambamile kutenda. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kulawa iisi pfailumbighwe kuduhu imunu yahulike ka imunu wowose kamhonetsa imunu iyelekighwe chifita. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ka imunu yuno ng'olawa bae kwa Imulungu, tsayang'alekile kudaha kusang'ana chochose!” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwelekighwa na kukulila mnzambi. Apfi udahatse kutulangulitsa?” Apfo Wayahudi wamuwinga imunu ayo mne Ing'anda ya Kulombela.</para>
  <para style="s">Ufita we ghumoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu tsakahulika imunu iyamuhonetse kawingighwa, hayamwonile kamghutsa, “Pfii kwomtoghola Imwana we Imunu?” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, apfi imunu ayo nani? Nongele nimtoghole!” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Sambi kumwona, yulonga naye iyo yuyo.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuya imunu ayo kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, notoghola,” kampfughamila Yesu ghamaghoti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nitsa muisi amu kuhigha, pfifita wone na iwanu iwakona wawe pfifita.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mafarisayo wangi iwakalile na Yesu wamhulika hayalongile pfino, wamghutsa, “Apfi kwolonga twetwe twa pfifita?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mng'awile pfifita, mng'akalile mwahela nzambi, lekeni kwaapfila mwolonga mwakona, mwemwe mng'ali mna nzambi.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye mdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose ka ng'akwingila bae mne libanda lya wang'olo kubitila halibani, ila kakwingila kwa nzila ingi ayo ka mbapfi na mbokaji. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Imunu iyakwingila kubitila libani ayo ka mdimi we wang'olo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mbetetsi kompfughulila libani, na wang'olo wohulikitsa litsi lya mdimi. Kowakema wang'olo wake kwa mataghwa, kowalongotsa kunze. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hayowalapfa kunze wang'olo wake kowalongola, na wang'olo wake womuwinza kwaapfila womanya litsi lyake. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lekeni ng'awomuwinza bae imunu yungi, watsomlema kwaapfila ng'awomanya bae litsi lye imunu yungi.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, lekeni ng'awamanyile bae chayawalongele.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamdimi yanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kalonga keli, “Nowalongela ghendo, nene nalibani lya wang'olo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanu wose iwanongole tsawabapfi na wabokaji, lekeni wang'olo ng'awawahulikitse bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nene nalibani. Imunu wowose iyakwingila kubitila nene katsokombolighwa. Katsakwingila na kulawa, naye katsopata ipfijo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Wabapfi wakutsa kwiba, kukoma na kuhinya, nene nitsa wawe ne ughima bwelele, na watsokala ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Nene namdimi yaninoghile. Mdimi yanoghile kolapfa ughima wake kwa wang'olo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Imunu yodima kwa kulihighwa na si mdimi yane iwang'olo bae. Hayomwona yumbwa wa kumuhulo kakutsa, kowaleka iwang'olo kotsuma. Apfo yumbwa wa kumuhulo kowaghogha iwang'olo na kowapwililisa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Imunu ayo kotsuma kwaapfila yeye ka imunu wa kulihighwa na ng'owalolesa bae wang'olo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Nene namdimi yaninoghile, nowamanya wang'olo wangu na wang'olo wangu wonimanya, <verse number="15" style="v"/>ka Aba pfayonimanya na nene nommanya Aba, na nowalapfila wang'olo ughima wangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nina wang'olo wangi, awo si wa banda lino. Pfipfila nobamighwa niwaghale. Pfipfila nawo watsohulika litsi lyangu, na kutsakuwa na kingili limwe na mdimi yumwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Nomnoghela Aba wangu kwaapfila nolapfa ughima wangu ili niubokele keli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuduhu imunu iyoniboka ughima wangu. Noulapfa imwenyegho ughima wangu kwaapfila nodaha kughulapfa na kughusola keli. Nibokela laghitso lino kulawa kwa Aba wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mbuli tsino tsa Yesu tsiwatenda Wayahudi weghole keli. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iwanu wemwenga walonga, “Kana chinyamkela na kamkwalukwale. Ule mwomtegheletsa?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lekeni wangi walonga, “Imunu yane chinyamkela ng'odaha bae kulonga pfino. Apfi chinyamkela kodaha kumhonetsa imunu chifita?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hako Yerusalemu tsakukala na Chihungo cha Kuika wakifu Ing'anda ye Imulungu, tsaghukala msimu ghwa chipfeghetsi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu yang'ali yakwanga mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu hane chitala cha Selemani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamtsunguluka wamghutsa, “Kutsotuleka tuleke kumanya mbaka tsuwachi? Tulongele mwatsimwatsi ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu Mkombotsi.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Tsaniwalongela, lekeni ng'amnitoghole bae. Pfihulo ipfanitenda kwa taghwa lya Aba wangu pfonilangusa, <verse number="26" style="v"/>lekeni mwemwe ng'amtoghola kwaapfila mwemwe si wang'olo wangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Wang'olo wangu wohulika litsi lyangu, nowamanya, nawo woniwinza. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Noweng'a ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, nawo ng'awatsakufa bae. Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwaboka mna ghamoko ghangu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Aba wangu, iyangaile, ka mkulu kubita wose, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwaboka kulawa mna ghamoko gha Aba wangu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nene na Aba twa chinu chimwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wayahudi wadondola keli ghamabwe wamtowe Yesu, <verse number="32" style="v"/>lekeni Yesu kawalongela, “Niwalangusa pfihulo pfingi ipfilawile kwa Aba. Apfi chihulo chachi ichiwatenda mnitowe ne ghamabwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Ng'atukwasila ghamabwe kwaapfila kutenda pfihulo, ila kwaapfila kumligha Imulungu! Ghweghwe kwa imunu, lekeni kwolonga ghweghwe kwa Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'ayandikighwe mne Ghamalaghitso ghenu Imulungu tsakalonga, ‘Mwemwe mwa walungu?’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakawakema walungu awala yaweng'ile usenga wake, na Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholongesa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Aba kanisaghula na kanituma nene muisi. Ule mwolonga nimligha Imulungu kwaapfila nilonga ‘Nene na lmwana we Imulungu?’ <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ka sisang'ana bae sang'ano tsa Aba wangu yanibamile nitsisang'ane mleke kunitoghola. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lekeni ka notsisang'ana sang'ano tsake na mng'ali mwolema kunitoghola, togholeni pfihulo pfangu, ili mmanye na mtange ka Aba ka mghati mwangu, na nene na mghati mwe Aba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuya wabama wamghoghe keli, lekeni Yesu kaswekuka kawaleka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu koya keli kumwambu mwe Ghumto Yoridani hanu Yohane hayakalile yobatitsa iwanu, kakala kuko. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi wamghendela Yesu. Walonga, “Yohane ng'atendile pfihulo, ila chila imbuli ye imunu yuno iyalongile Yohane ilongesa.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Baho iwanu wengi wamtoghola Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lifwa lya Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Imunu yumwe iyakemighwe Lazali tsamtamu. Lazali yang'ali yokala Betaniya, kaye yake Mariya ne ndughu yake Marita. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mariya yuno tsakakala yuyula iyambakile Imtwatsa Yesu ghamafuta ighonung'ila mmaghulu na kughabaghusa kwa mvili tsake, lumbu wake Lazali tsakakala mtamu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfo lumbu tsake Lazali wamtumila Yesu usenga, “Imtwatsa, sale yako yumnoghele koghula.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike apfi, kalonga, “Utamu uno ng'autsomkoma bae Lazali, utamu uno ulawila kwa utunitso we Imulungu ili Imwana we Imulungu yatunitsighwe kubitila utamu uno.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu tsakawanoghela Marita na lumbu wake na Lazali. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu hayahulike Lazali koghula, kongetsa ghamatsuwa meli gha kukala hala hayakalile. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tuye keli Yudeya.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ghamatsuwa chidogho ighalutile Wayahudi tsawabama wakutowe ne ghamabwe, ule kwobama ughende keli hanu hala?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Apfi misi yahela masaa kumi ne meli bae? Imunu iyokwanga nemisi ng'ekwala bae kwaapfila koghwona ghumwanga ghwe isi ino. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni imunu ang'anga nechilo kekwala, kwaapfila kahela ghumwanga.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu hayalongile apfi, kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Sale yetu Lazali kawasa, lekeni noghenda kumlamsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wamwidika, “Mtwatsa, ka kawasa, katsohona.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu tsayang'ali yolonga Lazali tsakafa lekeni iwanang'ina wake wapfikitsa Lazali tsakawasa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kawalongela mwatsimwatsi, “Lazali kafa, <verse number="15" style="v"/>lekeni kwaajili yenu nodeng'elela kwaapfila sikalile naye bae, ili mtoghole. Leka tumghendele.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Tomasi, iyakemighwe Basa kawalongela iwanang'ina wayaghe, “Leka tughende ne Mlangulitsi ili tufe naye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu utsilihuko na ughima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu hayapfikile, tsakapfika lukuli lwa Lazali lwikighwa mne likabuli ghamatsuwa mane ighalutile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kaye ya Betaniya tsaikala habehi ne Yerusalemu, utali wa maili mbili, <verse number="19" style="v"/>na Wayahudi wengi watsa kuwakanza Marita ne Mariya kwa ukufa kwa ndughu yawo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Marita hayahulike Yesu kakutsa, kaghenda kunze kwitingana na Yesu, lekeni Mariya tsakasighala mng'anda. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Marita kamlongela Yesu, “Mtwatsa, ka ung'awile hano, lumbu wangu tsa yang'alekile kufa! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lekeni nomanya hata sambi Imulungu katsokwing'a chochose chaumlomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Lumbu wako katsotsilihuka.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Marita kamwidika, “Nomanya katsotsilihuka keli mne litsuwa lya ukutsigha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Nene nautsilihuko ne ughima. Imunu iyonitoghola nene, ang'afa katsakuwa mghima, <verse number="26" style="v"/>na imunu wowose iyokala na kunitoghola nene ng'atsakufa bae. Pfii kwotoghola?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Marita kamwidika, “Ona, Mtwatsa! Nokutoghola ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana wa Imulungu, iyatsile mne isi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlilila Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Marita hayalongile pfino, kaghenda mng'anda kamkema Mariya chinyelenyele. Kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi kabaha, kokukema.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mariya hayahulike pfino, kenuka himahima kamghendela Yesu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na Yesu tsakakala ng'ana yapfike mkaye, ila kakala hanu hala hayetingane ne Marita. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wayahudi iwakalile mng'anda womkanza Mariya, hawamwonile Mariya kenuka himahima na kulawa kunze wamuwinza, wapfikitsa yang'ali yoghenda kulila mne likabuli. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mariya hayapfikile hanu hayali Yesu na hayamwonile, kamtowela ghamaghoti, kamlongela, “Mtwatsa, ka ung'awile hano, lumbu wangu tsa yang'alekile kufa!” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu hayamwonile Mariya kolila, na Wayahudi iwatsile na Mariya nawo wolila, Yesu kaghanzika mne ghumoyo ghwake, kona usungu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa, “Angu mumtsikile kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Mtwatsa, itsa wone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu kalila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kuya Wayahudi walonga, “Mlole pfayamnoghele!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wangi welongela, “Ka kamhonetsa imunu chifita, ule ng'adahile kumtenda Lazali aleke kufa?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komtsilihula Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu yang'ali yoghanzika keli mne ghumoyo ghwake, kaghenda mbaka mne likabuli, likabuli tsalikala imango iighubikighwe ne libwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu kawalaghitsa, “Mlibimbilise libwe!” Marita lumbu wa imunu iyafile kamwidika, “Mtwatsa, lekeni katsonung'a, ghamatsuwa mane ghabita kulawa yatsikighwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Apfi sikulongele bae ka ung'atoghola, kutsakona utunitso we Imulungu?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Apfo wabimbilisa libwe. Kuya Yesu kalola kulanga kalonga, “Aba, nolonga mighede kwaapfila kwonihulika. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nomanya ghamatsuwa ghose kwonihulika, lekeni nolonga pfino kwaajili ya iwanu iwemile hano, ili watoghole ghweghwe kunituma.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga apfi, kakemelela, “Lazali, lawa kunze!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Naye Lazali kalawa kunze, ghamoko na maghulu ghake ghoighwa isanda na ichihanga chake chighubikighwa chitambala.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Mdoholeni mumleke yoke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wobama kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:1-5; Maliki 14:1-2; Luka 22:1-2)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Apfo Wayahudi wengi iwaghendile kumwangila Mariya, waghona ghayatendile Yesu, na wamtoghola. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lekeni iwanu wangi woya kwa Mafarisayo wawalongela aghala ghayatendile Yesu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Apfo Mafarisayo na iwatambika wakulu wetingana ne iwanu we Libalatsa lye Wayahudi, weghutsa, “Tutende choni? Imunu yuno kotenda pfihulo pfingi.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Imtambika wa Chiyahudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tung'amleka aghendelele, iwanu wose watsomtoghola, kuya iwakulu wa Waroma watsakutsa kusola Ing'anda yetu ya ukulombela na isi yetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kuya yumwe wawo, iyakemighwe Kayafa, iyakalile Mtambika mkulu wa ghumwaka ghula, kalonga, “Mwawabotsi! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Apfi ng'ammanyile bae ka pfinogha kuna mwemwe imunu yumwe yafe kwaajili ya iwanu wose kubita isi yose ihinyighwe?” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ng'alongile bae kwa kubama imwenyegho, lekeni kwaapfila tsakakala mtambika mkulu wa ghumwaka ghula, tsakatabili Yesu katsakufa kwaajili ya isi ya Wayahudi, <verse number="52" style="v"/>kuya si kwaajili ya isi ila iliyeka, ila pfipfila kuweka hamwe iwana we Imulungu iwapwililike wawe wamwe. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Apfo kulawa litsuwa lila iwakulu wa Wayahudi wabama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu ng'aghendile bae mwatsimwatsi muisi ya Yudeya, ila kalawa ako kaghenda habehi na kunyika, kune kaye iikemighwe Efuremu, hao kakala ne iwanang'ina wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ichihungo che Ipasaka cha Wayahudi hachipfikile habehi, iwanu wengi wagheluka Yerusalemu ili wadeghesighwe ng'ana Ipasaka ipfike. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Wang'ali wombama Yesu, na hawetingane mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu weghutsa, “Mkwonatse? Apfi ng'atsakutsa bae mne lchihungo?” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lekeni iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo walapfa laghitso imunu wowose iyomanya kwayali Yesu, yalonge, ili wamghoghe.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Maria kombakatsa Yesu ghamafuta</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:6-13; Maliki 14:3-9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa sita ng'ana ichihungo che Ipasaka chipfike, Yesu kapfika Betaniya, ukaye kwa Lazali, imunu iyamtsilihule. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu wamwikila Yesu ichijo cha nemihe, Marita angali yowasang'anila. Lazali tsakakala yumwe we iwanu iwang'ali wakuja na Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Mariya kasola isupa ye ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya ighalawile mne ghummeya ighukemighwe narido, kambaka Yesu ghamaghulu na kumbaghusa kwa mvili tsake. Ing'anda yose tsainung'ila ghoya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yuda Isikarioti, yumwe wa iwanang'ina wake, iyatsomhunduka Yesu kaghutsa, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ule ghamafuta ghano ghang'autsighwe dinari miya ndatu na sendi weng'ighwe iwahingwa?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yuda tsakalonga pfino, si kwakuwonela libatsi iwahingwa, ila kalonga pfino kwaapfila tsakakala mbapfi, yeye yang'ali yokindagha ghumkoba ghwo ukwikila tsisendi na yang'ali yakwibagha tsisendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mleke! Katenda pfino kulyandaa litsuwa lya kutsikighwa kwangu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ghamatsuwa ghose mtsokala ne iwahingwa, lekeni ng'amtsokala na nene bae ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Iwatambika wakulu wobama kumkoma Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wayahudi wengi hawahulike Yesu kakala Betaniya waghenda, ng'awaghendile bae kumwona Yesu aliheka, pfipfila waghenda kumwona Lazali, imunu yula Yesu iyamtsilihule. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo iwatambika wakulu wabama inzila ye kumkoma Lazali, <verse number="11" style="v"/>kwa achila ichimlawile Lazali Wayahudi wengi wamghendela Yesu na kumtoghola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa kudeng'elighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 21:1-11; Maliki 11:1-11; Luka 19:28-40)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Litsuwa liwinzile iwanu wengi watsa mne Ichihungo che Ipasaka, tsawahulika Yesu ang'ali yakutsa Yerusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo wasola ghamaputila ghe mibiki, waghenda kumbokela, wakemelela, “Mtunitse Imulungu! Imulungu kambaliki iyakutsa kwa taghwa lya Imtwatsa, Imulungu kambaliki Imndewa wa Isiraeli!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu kamwona imwana punda, kamdina, ka pfayandikighwe mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mleke kupfuka, iwanu we Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q">Imndewa wenu kakutsa,</para>
  <para style="q">kadina imwana punda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mwanduso iwanang'ina wake ng'awamanyile bae mbuli tsino. Lekeni Yesu hayatsilihuke na kutunitsighwa, iwanang'ina wakumbuka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ighalongile mbuli tsake na ka wanu wamtendela pfinu apfo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwanu iwakalile na Yesu hayamkemile Lazali kulawa mne likabuli na kumtsilihula, walonga aghala ighalawile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi waghenda kutingana na Yesu kwaapfila tsawahulika Yesu katenda chihulo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apfo Mafarisayo welongela, “Mlole, ng'atudaha kutenda chochose. Iwanu wose womuwinza!”</para>
  <para style="s">Wagiriki wobama kulonga na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kukala na Wagiriki wengi mne iwanu iwatsile Yerusalemu kutamanila mne ichihungo cha Ipasaka. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wamghendela Filipi, iyalawile Betisaida mne isi ya Galilaya wamlongela, “Mkulu, twobama tumwone Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filipi kaghenda, kamlongela Andereya, kuya wose weli waghenda kumlongela Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Chipindi chipfika che Imwana we Imunu kutunyighwa! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, ka mbeghu ye uhemba ng'ailaghale mdongo na ukufa, yokala pfipfo imwe iliyeka. Lekeni ing'afa na ukota, itsokweleka mbeghu bwelele. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imunu iyounoghela ughima wake katsowaghitsa, ila imunu iyouhila ughima wake katsokwing'ighwa ughima we ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyobama kunitumikila yaniwinze, hohose hanikala imtumwa wangu akale baho. Aba wangu katsomtoghola imunu iyonitumikila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli tsa lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Sambi ghumoyo ghwangu ghwoghanzika, na nene nonge choni? ‘Aba unikombole mne chipindi chino?’ Bae, acho chicho chanitsile, nibite chipindi chino cha maghayo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Aba, litunye taghwa lyako!”</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Nilitunya na nitsolitunya keli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwanu wengi iwemile hala wahulika litsi lila, iwanu wangi walonga kukala na mdumo, lekeni iwanu wangi walonga, “Malaika kalonga naye!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bali Yesu kawalongela, “Litsi lino ng'alinitsile nene bae lekeni liwatsilani mwemwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Chipindi cha kuhighighwa isi ino chipfika, mkulu we isi ino katsowingighwa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hanitsokwinulighwa muisi, nitsowakwegha iwanu wose kuna nene.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga pfino kulangusa pfayatsokufa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mtingano we iwanu wamghutsa, “Ghamalaghitso ghetu tsaghalonga Kiristu katsokala ghamatsuwa ghose. Ule lelo kwolonga ‘Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yenulighwe?’ Apfi Imwana yuno we Imunu nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mtsokala ne ghumwanga kwa chipindi chidodo. Mwange hamng'ali nawo ghumwanga, ng'ana ichisi chiwatsile. Imunu iyokwanga mchisi ng'omanya bae koyoghenda. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mtoghole ghumwanga hamng'ali nawo, ili muwe iwana we ghumwanga.” Hayamalitse kulonga apfi, Yesu koka, kepfisa waleke kumwona.</para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wolema kumtoghola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hata ka Yesu tsakasang'ana pfihulo hambele hawo, lekeni ng'awamtoghole bae. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Agha ghose ghalawila ghatimile aghala ghayalongile Nabii Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q">“Imtwatsa, nani iyautoghole usenga wetu?</para>
  <para style="q">Na ghumoko ghwa Imtwatsa ughubulighwa kwa nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Apfo ng'awadahile bae kutoghola, kwaapfila Isaya pfipfila tsakalonga keli.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Nitsowabopfula nenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsotsibumbuwatsa mbutsi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">waleke kwona kwa tsinenge tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">waleke kumanya kwa mbutsi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q">waleke kunihundukila, na kuwahonetsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isaya tsakalonga apfi kwaapfila tsakawona utunitso wa Yesu na kulonga mbuli tsake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Hata iwakulu wangi wa Wayahudi tsawamtoghola Yesu. Lekeni ng'awadahile bae kulonga mwatsimwatsi kwaapfila wapfuka Mafarisayo watsowawinga mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsawanoghelighwa sideke kutunyighwa ne iwanu kubita kutunyighwa ne Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsa Yesu tsitsohigha iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesu kakemelela, “Imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene, ng'onitoghola nene niliyeka bae ila pfipfila komtoghola ayula iyanitumile. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Imunu wowose iyombona nene komwona yula iyanitumile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Nitsa muisi niwe ghumwanga, ili iwanu wose iwonitoghola waleke kukala mchisi. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ka imunu kotegheletsa mbuli tsangu na ng'otsikinda bae, sitsomuhigha bae. Kwaapfila sitsile bae kuhigha iisi lekeni nitsa kuikombola. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yeye iyondema nene na kulema mbuli tsangu, ayo kenaye wa kumhigha. Mbuli tsila tsanongile tsitsomhigha mna litsuwa lya ukutsigha. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kwaapfila silonga bae kwa ukulu wangu, ila Aba wangu iyanitumile kandaghitsa chokulonga, na nilongetse. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nomanya laghitso lyake lyoghala ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. Apfo nolonga aghala Aba wangu ghayandaghitse nighalonge.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahopfugha ghamaghulu iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tsaikala ichihungo che Ipasaka ng'ana chipfike. Yesu tsakamanya saa yake ya ukuka kulawa iisi ino na kughenda kwa Aba wake ipfika. Tsakawanoghela ng'ani iwanu wake iwali muisi, kawalangusa unoghelo wake ing'autsigha bae. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wang'ali wakuja ichijo cha nemihe, yehile ma tsakamwingila Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Isikarioti, mne ghumoyo ghwake, kumhunduka Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya Aba kamwing'a ghose mna ghamoko ghake, tsakamanya kalawila kwa Imulungu na kakuya kwe Imulungu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Apfo kenuka mmetsa, keka mmbalimbali gholole lyake, keyoha lighwanda lingi mchuno. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya keka ghamatsi mchiya, kandusa kuwahopfugha ghamaghulu iwanang'ina wake na kuwabaghusa kwa lighwanda ilili mchuno mwake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kapfika hayali Simoni Petiri, iyamghutsile Yesu, “Imtwatsa, ghweghwe uhopfughe ghamaghulu ghangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Chanisang'ana sambi ghweghwe ng'uchimanyile bae, lekeni kutsochimanya hambele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petiri kalonga, “Bae, ng'utsoghahopfugha bae ghamaghulu ghangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ka sighahopfugha bae ghamaghulu ghako, ng'utsakuwa keli bae imwanang'ina wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, uleke kughahopfugha ghamaghulu ghangu ghaliyeka, ila pfipfila uhopfughe na ghamoko ghangu na litwi lyangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kedika, “Imunu yoghile kela lukuli lwose na kobamighwa yofughe ghamaghulu ghaliyeka. Mwemwe mwela ila si wose bae.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu tsakalonga si wose bae iwelile kwaapfila tsakamanya imunu iyoghenda kumhunduka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kuwahopfugha ghamaghulu ghawo, kapfala keli gholole lyake kakala hanu hake. Kawaghutsa, “Apfi mghamanya ghaniwatendele?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwonikema Mlangulitsi na Imtwatsa, mwotenda ghoya kwaapfila apfo pfipfo pfanili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nene na Imtwatsa na Mlangulitsi wenu, niwahopfugha mwemwe ghamaghulu ghenu, namwe pfipfila mwihopfughe ghamaghulu ghenu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nimlangutsani nzila ya kutenda, namwe mtende ka pfaniwatendele. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, kuduhu mtumwa imkulu kubita imtwatsa wake, na kuduhu mtumwa imkulu kubita yula iyamtumile. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lelo mwopfimanya pfinu pfino, mng'atenda mtsobweda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Siwalonga bae mwemwe wose, nowamanya awala yaniwasaghule. Lekeni leka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimile igholonga, ‘Imunu yanikuja naye kanihunduka.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Sambi nowalongela ng'ana chilawile, ili hachitsolawila mtsotoghola ‘Nene iyo Yeye.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nowalongelani ghendo, imunu wowose iyombokela imunu yanimtumile kombokela nene, na imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene kombokela ayula iyanitumile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili imunu iyatsomhunduka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:20-25; Maliki 14:17-21; Luka 22:21-23)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga apfi, kona usungu ng'ani mne ghumoyo ghwake, kalonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, yumwe wenu katsonihunduka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake tsawelolesa na ng'awamanyile bae yang'ali yomlonga nani. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imwanang'ina yumwe, iyanoghelighwe na Yesu, tsakakala habehi naye. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kampfinyighitsa na kulonga, “Mghutse yomlonga nani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Imwanang'ina ayo kasoghela habehi na Yesu, kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, umlonga nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu yula iyanimwing'a chihande che chighate chanipfabika mwibakuli, ayo iyo yeye.” Kuya kasola chihande che chighate, kachipfabika, kamwing'a Yuda, imwana wa Simoni Isikarioti. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bahala Yuda hayasolile chighate, Setani kamwingila. Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Tenda himahima chaubama kutenda!” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lekeni mna iwanu wala iwang'ali wakuja tsahaduhu imunu iyamanyile ule Yesu tsakamlongela pfino. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Yuda tsakakala mkinda mkoba ghwa sendi, iwanang'ina wangi wapfikitsa Yesu yang'ali yomlongela Yuda yaghende kughula ipfinu ipfibamighwa mne Ichihungo, au kuweng'a chinu iwahingwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bahala Yuda hayasolile chighate, kalawa kunze. Tsaikala nechilo.</para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso lya sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuda hayokile, Yesu kalonga, “Lelo utunitso we Imwana we Imunu woneka, na utunitso we Imulungu woneka kubitila yeye. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ka utunitso we Imulungu ughubulighwa kubitila yeye, kuya Imulungu imwenyegho katsoughubula utunitso we Imwana we Imunu, na baho katsomtunya. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanangu, nitsokala namwe chidodo. Mtsombama, lekeni sambi nowalongela achila chaniwalongele Wayahudi, ‘Kwanighenda ng'amdaha kutsa bae.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lelo noweng'a laghitso lya sambi. Mwinoghele. Ka pfaniwanoghele, namwe mwinoghele pfipfo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mng'enoghela, iwanu wose watsomanya mwemwe mwa iwanang'ina wangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili Petiri katsomhunduka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:31-35; Maliki 14:27-31; Luka 22:31-34)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, ughenda kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ng'udaha bae sambi kuniwinza hanu hanighenda, lekeni hambele kutsoniwinza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Petiri kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa ule sidaha kukuwinza sambi? Nene nitsokulapfila ughima wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kodaha kundapfila nene ughima wako? Nokulongela ghendo, jogholo ng'ana yeke bae kutsonibela mala ndatu!</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu inzila ya kughenda kwa Aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Mleke kughanzika mne mimoyo yenu, mtogholeni Imulungu, pfipfila mnitoghole nene. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mng'anda kwa Aba wangu kuna pfiheleto pfingi, ka si pfipfo bae, ning'awalongele. Lelo noghenda kuwaandalila hanu henu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ning'aghenda, noghenda kuwaandalila hanu henu, nitsowoyila na kuwasola ili mkale hala nene hanikala. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mwoimanya inzila ya hanu hanighenda.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomasi kamghutsa, “Imtwatsa, ng'atumanyile bae kwani kwaughenda, lelo tuimanyetse inzila ayo?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nene na inzila, kweli na ughima. Haduhu imunu iyodaha kughenda kuna Aba ka ng'abitile bae kuna nene. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mng'animanyile nene, pfipfila mng'ammanyile Aba wangu na kulawa sambi mwommanya na mumwona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filipi kamlongela, “Imtwatsa, tulanguse Aba ayo, ayo iyo yuyo yatumbama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Filipi nikala namwe matsuwa mengi, ung'ali ng'unimanyile bae? Imunu wowose iyambonile nene kamwona Aba. ‘Ule kwolonga tulanguse Aba?’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfi ng'autoghola bae ka nene namghati mwa Aba, naye kamghati mwangu? Mbuli tsanilonga si tsangu bae, ila Aba iyokala mghati mwangu kosang'ana ng'onde yake. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mnoghole haniwalongela nene namghati mwa Aba naye Aba kamghati mwangu. Ka ng'utoghola imbuli yangu, toghola pfinu pfanitendile. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, imunu iyonitoghola nene katsotenda apfila pfanendile, katsotenda ipfinu pfikulu kubita pfino, kwaapfila nene noghenda kwa Aba wangu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nitsowatendelani chochose chamlomba kwa taghwa lyangu, ili utunitso wa Aba woneke kubitila Imwana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mng'anilomba ichinu chochose kwa taghwa lyangu, nitsowatendelani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga katsowaghalila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ka mwoninoghela, mtsoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nitsomlomba Aba, naye katsomwing'ani Mwapfitsi yungi, katsokala namwe ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ayo Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu iyoighubula kweli. Iwanu wa isi ng'awodaha bae kumbokela kwaapfila ng'awodaha bae kumwona na kummanya. Lekeni mwemwe mwommanya, kwaapfila kokala namwe na katsokuwa mghati mwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Hanitsakuka, siwaleka bae mliyeka ka wachuwa, nitsowoyila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mne ichipindi chidodo ichikutsa iwanu wa iisi ng'awatsombona keli bae, lekeni mwemwe mtsombona, kwaapfila namghima, pfipfila namwe mtsakuwa waghima. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa alyo mtsomanya nene namghati mwa Aba wangu, namwe mwamghati mwangu, na nene namghati mwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Iwanu wala iwobokela ghamalaghitso ghangu na kughakinda, iwanuwo woninoghela. Aba wangu katsowanoghela iwanu wala iwonoghela nene, pfipfila nene nitsowanoghela na nitselangusa kuna wawo.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yuda, si Yuda Isikarioti bae kalonga, “Imtwatsa, ebali kobama kwilangusa kuna twetwe tuliyeka na si kwe iwanu we isi yose bae?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu wowose iyonoghela nene katsoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu. Aba wangu katsomnoghela, nene na Aba wangu tutsomtsila na kukala naye. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ing'ayoninoghela ng'oghakinda bae ghamalangulitso ghangu. Ghamalangulitso ighamuhulike si ghangu bae, gholawa kwa Aba iyanitumile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Niwalongela ghano haning'ali namwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aba wangu katsowatumila Mwapfitsi, Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kwa taghwa lyangu, katsowalangulitsa mmanye ipfinu pfose na kuwatenda mkumbuke chila ichinu chaniwalongele.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Nowalekela iamani, noweng'a iamani yangu. Siweng'a bae ka isi pfaitendagha. Mleke kughanzika. Mleke kupfuka. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tsamuhulika haniwalongele, ‘Noghenda, kuya nitsowoyila.’ Ka tsamninoghela mng'adeng'elele nene kughenda kwa Aba, kwaapfila Aba kamkulu kubita nene. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Niwalongela ng'ana ghalawile, ili haghatsolawila mtoghole. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Sitsolonga keli bae namwe mbuli nyingi, kwaapfila imkulu wa iisi ino kakutsa. Hayo kahela ngupfu kuna nene, <verse number="31" style="v"/>lekeni iwanu we iisi wamanye ka nene nomnoghela Aba, nosang'ana chichila Aba wangu chayanilaghitse.</para>
  <para style="p">“Mwinuke tukeni.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ka mtsabibu wa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nene na mtsabibu wa kweli, na Aba wangu iyo iyolima. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Koghana ghamaputila ghose ghang'aghakweleka, kohalilila ghamaputila ghose ighakweleka ghamatunda, ili gheleke ng'ani. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwemwe ma mdegheta kwa imbuli ila yaniwalongeleni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mkale mghati mwangu, na nene nitsokala mghati mwenu. Haduhu putila ilidaha kweleka lyenyegho, lyobamighwa likale mne mbiki. Pfipfila namwe ng'amdaha bae kweleka ghamatunda mbaka mkale mghati mwangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nene na mtsabibu, mwemwe mwa ghamaputila. Imunu ang'akala mghati mwangu na nene ng'ale mghati mwake, ayo katsakweleka ghamatunda mengi, kwaapfila mwemwe mliyeka ng'amdaha bae kutenda chochose. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ka ng'okala bae mghati mwangu, keghala ne putila ilikwasighwa kutali na kunyala. Ghamaputila agho ghokungighwa, ghokwasighwa mmoto, gholakatsighwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mng'akala mghati mwangu na mbuli tsangu tsing'akala mghati mwenu, mlombe chinu chochose chambama, mtsokwing'ighwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Aba wangu kotunyighwa mwemwe mng'eleka ghamatunda mengi, namwe mtsakuwa iwanang'ina wangu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nowanoghela mwemwe ka Aba pfayanoghele nene. Lelo mkale aku mwomanya ka nomnoghelani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mng'aghakinda malaghitso ghangu, mtsokala mne unoghelo wangu, ka nene pfanighakindile ghamalaghitso gha Aba na nikala mne unoghelo wake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Tsaniwalongela agha ghose ili ndeng'elelo yangu ikale mghati mwenu na ndeng'elelo yenu ileke kumala. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Alino laghitso lyangu, mwinoghele ka pfaniwanoghele mwemwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kuduhu unoghelo mkulu kubita unoghelo wa imunu iyoulapfa ughima wake kwaajili ya sale tsake. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwa sale tsangu mng'atenda achila chaniwalaghitse. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sitsowakema keli mwemwe watumwa bae, kwaapfila mtumwa ng'omanya sang'ano tse mtwatsa wake. Lekeni nowakema mwemwe sale tsangu, kwaapfila niwalongela ghose ghanihulike kwa Aba wangu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Si mwemwe bae yamnisaghule, ila nene yanimsaghuleni mghende na mweleke ghamatunda, ghamatunda ing'aghoupa bae. Kuya Aba katsomwing'ani chochose ichamlomba kwa taghwa lyangu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Alino laghitso lyangu kuna mwemwe, Mwinoghele.</para>
  <para style="s">Isi yowahila Iwanang'ina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Iwanu we iisi wang'awahilani, mmanye ka tsawalongola kunihila nene. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mng'awile we iisi ino, iwanu wa iisi wang'amnogheleni ka iwanu wake. Lekeni kwaapfila mwemwe si wa isi ino, ila nene nimsaghulani mghati mwe iwanu we isi ino. Kwaajili ayo iwanu wa isi womuhilani. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mkumbuke chaniwalongele, ‘Imtumwa si mkulu bae kubita imtwatsa wake.’ Ka iwanu wandununza nene, namwe pfipfila watsowadununzani. Wang'aghakinda ghamalangulitso ghangu, pfipfila watsoghakinda ghamalangulitso ghenu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Watsowatendela agha ghose kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwanu wangu, kwaapfila ng'awammanyile bae yula iyanitumile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ka sitsile bae na kulonga nawo, wang'alongile wahela nzambi, lekeni sambi ng'awodaha bae kwiyamila ka wahela nzambi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imunu iyonihila nene, pfipfila komhila Aba wangu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ka sighatendile bae kuna wawo aghala ng'ana ghatendighwe ne imunu yungi, sambi wang'akalile wahela nzambi. Lekeni sambi wapfona pfihulo pfanendile, nawo wang'ali wotuhila wose nene na Aba wangu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lekeni ilawila pfino kutimitsa imbuli iyandikighwe mne Ghamalaghitso ghawo. ‘Wanihila hela.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Nitsomtuma Mwapfitsi kulawa kwa Aba, ayo Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. Ayo katsoghubula ukweli we Imulungu, na katsowalongela mbuli tsangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pfipfila namwe mwobamighwa kulonga mbuli tsangu, kwaapfila mkala na nene kulawa mwanduso.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Niwalongela ghano ghose ili mleke ukwaghitsa ukutoghola kwenu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iwanu watsowawinga mne Ing'anda ya Ukulombela, na chipindi chakutsa chila yatsowakoma katsopfikitsa komlapfila Imulungu inambiko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iwanu watsowatendelani ghano kwaapfila ng'awommanya Aba, wala ng'awonimanya nene. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nimlongelani ghano, ili chipindi hachitsakutsa mkumbuke aghala ghaniwalongele.</para>
  <para style="s">Ng'onde ya Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka</para>
  <para style="p">“Siwalongele ghano kulawa mwanduso kwaapfila tsanahamwe namwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Sambi noghenda kwa ayula iyanitumile, haduhu imunu iyonighutsa, ‘Ughenda kwani?’ <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwaapfila niwalongela agha ghose, mimoyo yenu imema usungu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni nowalongela ghendo, pfinogha kuna mwemwe nene mbuke, kwaapfila ka sikuka bae, Mwapfitsi ng'atsowatsilani. Lekeni ning'aghenda, nitsomghalilani. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Naye hayatsakutsa, katsolangusa iwanu wa iisi ka wakwalangula pfihile mne mbuli tsa nzambi, na mne mbuli tsa kutenda haki na Imulungu pfayohigha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tsawatotsa mne mbuli tsa nzambi, kwaapfila ng'awanitoghole, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tsawatotsa mne mbuli tsa haki, kwaapfila noghenda kwa Aba, wala ng'amtsombona keli, <verse number="11" style="v"/>na watotsa mne mbuli tsa kuhigha, kwaapfila Setani ma kahighighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Nina mbuli nyingi tsa kumlongelani, ila sambi ng'amdaha bae kutsidudumila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu hayatsokutsa, katsowalongotsa mmanye ukweli wose. Ng'atsolonga kwa uwetso wake bae, katsolonga aghala ghayahulike na katsowalongela aghala ighakutsa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hayo katsonitunya nene, kwaapfila katsowalangulitsa ghose ghayapatile kuna nene. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pfinu pfose iyali napfo Aba pfa kwangu. Ndo mana tsaniwalongela Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka katsowalangulitsa aghala ghayapatile kuna nene.</para>
  <para style="s">Usungu na Ndeng'elelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mne ichipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona keli, kuya ichipindi chidodo hambele mtsombona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wake wangi weghutsa, “Angu mbuli yachi ino hayalongile, ‘Mne ichipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona keli, kuya ichipindi chidodo hambele mtsombona?’ Kuya kolonga ‘Kwaapfila noghenda kwa Aba?’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Waghendelela kwighutsa, ‘Ichipindi chidodo’ choni? Ng'atumanyile kolonga imbuli yachi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kamanya chawabamile kumghutsa, apfo kawalongela, “Pfii mweghutsa tsanongile choni hanilongile, ‘Mne ichipindi chidodo ng'amtsombona keli, kuya ichipindi chidodo hambele mtsombona’? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo, mtsolila na kwona usungu mne mimoyo, lekeni isi itsodeng'elela. Mtsakuwa na usungu, ila usungu wenu utsoghaluka ndeng'elelo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ipinga hayakweleka, kana usungu kwaapfila ichipindi chake cha kudununzika chipfika, lekeni imwana ang'oneka kosemwa usungu wake, kodeng'elela kwaapfila imwana koneka muisi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Namwe pfipfila, sambi mna usungu, lekeni nitsomwonani keli, namwe mtsodeng'elela, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuwaboka ndeng'elelo yenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mne litsuwa lila ng'amtsonilomba chinu chochose. Nowalongela ghendo, Aba wangu katsomwing'ani chinu chochose chamlomba kwa taghwa lyangu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mbaka sambi ng'amlombile chinu chochose kwa taghwa lyangu. Mlombe, mtsobokela, na ndeng'elo yenu itsotimila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaihuma iisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Niwalongelani agha ghose kwa tsimbuli. Ichipindi chitsakutsa sitsolonga namwe kwa tsimbuli bae, ila nitsolonga mwatsimwatsi mbuli tsa Aba wangu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mne litsuwa lila mtsolomba kwa taghwa lyangu. Siwalongela ka nitsowalombela kwa Aba, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Aba imwenyegho kowanoghelani. Kowanoghelani kwaapfila tsamninoghela nene na mtoghola ka ndawa kwe Imulungu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ndawa kwa Aba, nitsa muisi, lelo noileka iisi nakuya kwa Aba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina wake wamlongela, “Sambi kwolonga mwatsimwatsi bila ya tsimbuli. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lelo twomanya kwomanya ghose, apfo ng'atubama bae kukughutsa keli. Chinu achi chotutenda tutoghole ka kulawa kwe Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu kawedika, “Pfii sambi mtoghola?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ichipindi chakutsa, kuya ma chipfika, mwemwe wose mtsopwililika, chila imunu na ukaye yake. Mwemwe wose mtsondeka niliyeka. Lekeni siliyeka bae, kwaapfila na hamwe na Aba wangu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Niwalongela agha ghose, ili mwilunge na nene na mkale tseghamba. Mne iisi ino mtsodununzika. Lekeni mwighangamitse! Niihuma iisi ino.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalombela iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulonga ghano, kalola kulanga kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p">“Aba, chipindi chipfika. Watende iwanu wawone utunitso wa Imwanagho ili wawone utunitso wako kubitila Imwanagho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaapfila kumwing'a Imwanagho uwetso kwe iwanu wose, ili yaweng'e ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose wose waumwing'ile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Auno iwo ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, iwanu wakumanye ghweghwe Imulungu uliyeka wa kweli, na wammanye Yesu Kiristu yaumtumile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niulangusa utunitso wako mne isi kwa kuimalitsa ng'onde yungaile niisang'ane. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Aba! Lelo unitunye, utunitso uhula yaning'ali nawo hamwe naghwe hala ng'ana iisi ilumbighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Nilitenda taghwa lyako limanyike kwa iwanu wala yungaile muisi. Tsawakala wako, naghwe kungaya nene nawo waikinda imbuli yako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sambi womanya ipfinu pfose pfaungaile pfolawa kuna ghweghwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwaapfila niweng'a mbuli tsaungaile nawo watsitoghola, na wamanya ghendo ndawa kuna ghweghwe, watoghola ghweghwe kunituma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nowalombela. Siwalombela bae iwanu we iisi, ila nowalombela iwanu wala yungaile, kwaapfila awano iwo wako. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iwanu wose wanilinawo wako, na wose yaulinawo wangu. Na utunitso woneka kubitila wawo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Sambi nakutsa kuna ghweghwe, sili muisi keli bae, lekeni wawo wang'ali muisi. Aba Mwenzeluka! Walolese kwa ngupfu ya taghwa lyaungaile, ili wawe wamwe ka ghweghwe na nene pfatuli wamwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Haning'ali nawo, niwalolesa kwa ingupfu ya taghwa lyako lyaungaile. Kuduhu imunu yaghile ila yula iyasaghulighwe kwagha, ili Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimile. <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Sambi nakutsa kuna ghweghwe, tsanonga ghano ghose haning'ali muisi, ili wameme ndeng'elo yangu mne mimoyo yawo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Niweng'a imbuli yako na iwanu wa iisi wawahila, kwaapfila wawo si wa iisi ino bae, na nene si wa iisi ino bae. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sikulomba bae uwalapfe muisi, ila nokulomba uwalolese na ayula Yehile. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nene si wa iisi ino, nawo pfipfila si wa iisi ino bae. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uwatende wawe wako kwa kweli yako, imbuli yako iyo kweli. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Niwatuma muisi, ka ghweghwe pfaunitumile muisi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nelapfa imwenyegho kwaajili yawo, ili nawo welapfe ghendo kuna ghweghwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Siwalombela wawo waliyeka bae, ila pfipfila nowalombela iwanu wala iwatsonitoghola kwa usenga wawo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nolomba wose wawe wamwe. Aba, nolomba wakale mghati mwetu, ka ghweghwe pfaukala mghati mwangu na nene pfanikala mghati mwako, ili iwanu we isi watoghole ka ghweghwe kunituma. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Niweng'a utunitso uhula yungaile, ili wawe wamwe ka twetwe pfatuli wamwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nene niwe mghati mwawo, naghwe uwe mghati mwangu, nolomba wawe wamwe ghendo, ili iwanu we iisi wamanye ghweghwe kunituma, na nene niwanoghela ka ghweghwe pfaunoghele nene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Aba, nobama iwanu wala yungaile wakale na nene hanu hanili, ili wawone utunitso wangu. Utunitso yungaile, kwaapfila tsakuninoghela ng'ana iisi ilumbighwe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Aba unoghile! Iwanu we iisi ng'awakumanyile bae, lekeni nene nokumanya, na wano womanya ka kunituma. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nikutenda wakumanye, na nitsoghendelela kutenda apfo, ili unoghelo wako kuna nene ukale mghati mwawo, na nene nikale mghati mwawo.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:47-56; Maliki 14:43-50; Luka 22:47-53)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu hayamalitse kulomba, yeye ne iwanang'ina wake waloka kumwambu mwa lwanda Kidironi. Hanu hala tsahana mghunda we mibiki, Yesu na iwanang'ina wake wengila amwo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yuda, iyamhunduke Yesu, tsakahamanya hanu hala kwaapfila Yesu tsakaghendagha ne iwanang'ina wake. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfo Yuda kaghenda mne mghunda aghwo, hamwe ne kingili lya asikali na iwabetetsi wangi iwatumighwe na iwatambika wakulu na Mafarisayo. Tsawatsa ne pfitasa, pfiwenge na tsisilaha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya ghose ighatsomlawila, kawaghendela kawaghutsa, “Mumbama nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Natsareti,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kawalongela, “Nene iyo yuyo.” Yuda iyamhunduke tsakakala kema baho hamwe nawo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu hayawalongele, “Nene iyo yuyo,” woya kuchughu waghwa hasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kawaghutsa keli, “Mumbama nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Yesu wa Natsareti.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Tsaniwalongela nene iyo yuyo, ka mwombama nene, walekeni wano wangi woke.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kalonga apfi ili aghala ghayalongile ghatimile, “Iwanu awala yungaile simwaghitse bae hata yumwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya Simoni Petiri, tsakakala ne limaghe, kalisomola, kamsepula ghutwi lye kujilo imtumwa we Imtambika mkulu. Imtumwa ayo tsakakemighwa Malikusi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kamlaghitsa Petiri, “Yuitsa limaghe lyako. Pfii ndeke kuchinwa ichikombe cha maghayo chayangaile Aba?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kuya asikali na imbala wawo na iwabetetsi we Ing'anda ye Imulungu ya Wayahudi wamghogha Yesu, wamwoha, <verse number="13" style="v"/>tanu wamghala kwa Anasi. Anasi tsakakala mkwe yake Kayafa, Kayafa tsakakala Imtambika mkulu mwaka ghula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kayafa iyo yuyula iyawalongele iwakulu we Wayahudi, ng'apfu imunu yumwe yafe kwaajili ye iwanu wose.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:69-70; Maliki 14:66-68; Luka 22:55-57)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri ne imwanang'ina yungi wamuwinza Yesu. Kwaapfila imwanang'ina yula yungi tsakamanyika ne Imtambika mkulu, apfo kengila hamwe na Yesu hachikuta che Iwatambika wakulu, <verse number="16" style="v"/>lekeni Petiri kema kunze mwa libani. Kuya imwanang'ina yula yungi koya, kalonga na ipinga mbetetsi wa libani, kuya ipinga ayo kamlongela Petiri yengile. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ipinga iyobetetsa libani kalonga na Petiri, “Apfi naghwe si imwanang'ina wa imunu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri kamwidika, “Bae, nene si mwanang'ina wake.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsakukala na chipfeghetsi, iwatumwa na iwabetetsi wabwina ghumoto, wang'ali wakota. Naye Petiri kema hamwe nawo, kota ghumoto.</para>
  <para style="s">Imtambika mkulu komghutsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:59-66; Maliki 14:55-64; Luka 22:66-71)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imtambika mkulu kamghutsa Yesu mbuli tsa iwanang'ina wake ne ghamalangulitso ghake. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nilonga mwatsimwatsi ne iwanu wose, ghamatsuwa ghose tsanilangulitsa mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela na mne tsing'anda tse Imulungu, hawetinganila hamwe Wayahudi wose. Silongile bae ichinu chochose chinyelenyele. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ule kwonighutsa nene? Waghutse yawanihulike. Waghutse chaniwalongele, womanya chanilongile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu hayalongile ghano, imbetetsi yumwe yemile habehi kamtsaba Yesu chibawo kalonga, “Ule umwidika apfi Imtambika mkulu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ka nilonga ichinu chihile, uchilonge hambele he iwanu. Lekeni ka nongesa, ule kwonitowa?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kuya Anasi kamghala Yesu kwa Kayafa Imtambika mkulu aku yang'ali kohighwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela keli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 26:71-75; Maliki 14:69-72; Luka 22:58-62)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri tsayang'ali kema baho kakota ghumoto, iwanu wangi wamghutsa, “Ambe naghwe pfipfila kwa imwanang'ina wa imunu yuno?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri kabela kalonga, “Si nene bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Imtumwa yumwe wa Imtambika mkulu, ndughu yake imunu yula iyasepulighwe lighutwi na Petiri kamghutsa, “Angu sikwonile naye mne mghunda we imibiki?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petiri kabela keli, kalonga, “Bae.” Bahala jogholo keka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:1-2,11-14; Maliki 15:1-5; Luka 23:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo Yesu tsakasolighwa mne ing'anda ya Kayafa kaghalighwa mne ing'anda ye imkulu wa Roma. Iwakulu we Wayahudi ng'awengile mng'anda, kwaapfila ng'awabamile wehe, ili wadahe kuchija ichijo che Ipasaka. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pilato kalawa kunze kawaghutsa, “Apfi imunu yuno kana ghomba lyachi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wamwidika, “Ka ng'atendile totso tung'alekile kukughalila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pilato kawedika, “Msoleni mkamuhighe kwa ghamalaghitso ghenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wayahudi wamwidika, “Ng'atubamighwa bae kumkoma imunu wowose.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ilawila pfino ili tsitimile mbuli tsayalongile Yesu kulangusa katsokufatse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kuya Pilato kengila keli mng'anda, kamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Agha ghaunighutsa ghalawa mghati mwako au iwanu wangi wakulongela mbuli tsangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilato kamwidika, “Apfi kwopfikitsa nene na Myahudi? Iwanu wako na iwatambika wako wakulu wakughala kuna nene. Angu utendile choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga, “Undewa wangu si wa iisi ino bae, undewa wangu ung'awile wa iisi ino, iwatumighwa wangu wang'etowile na Wayahudi waleke kungogha. Bali undewa wangu si wa iisi ino!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pilato kamghutsa, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa mndewa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwolonga nene namndewa. Nyelekighwa na nitsa muisi kwaajili ayo, kulonga mbuli tsa ukweli. Iwanu wose iwonoghela ukweli wonitegheletsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pilato kamghutsa, “Ukweli chinu chachi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:1-2,11-14; Maliki 15:1-5; Luka 23:1-5)</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya Pilato kalawa keli kunze kawalongela Wayahudi, “Sonile bae ghomba lya kumhigha imunu yuno. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lekeni mne ichihendo chenu, nomlekelagha mwohighwa yumwe mne ghamatsuwa gha Ipasaka. Mwobama niwalekeleleni Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wakemelela, “Bae, si yuno bae! Twombama Baraba! Baraba tsaang'ali yoboka iwanu.”</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuya Pilato kalaghitsa Yesu yasolighwe, yapfapulighwe pfiboko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Asikali wabota fiya ya tsimiwa walika mwitwi mwake. Kuya wampfatsa lighwanda lye chindewa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wamghendela wamlongela, “Mbukwa, imndewa wa Wayahudi!” Wamtowa makofi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato kalawa keli kunze kawalongela Wayahudi, “Mlole, nomlapfa kunze na mmanye sipatile ghomba lya kumhigha.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo Yesu kalawa kunze kapfala fiya ya tsimiwa na lighwanda lye chindewa. Pilato kawalongela, “Mlole! Hayuno ano!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iwatambika wakulu na iwabetetsi we Ing'anda ye Imulungu hawamwonile Yesu, wakemelela, “Muwambe! Muwambe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato kawalongela, “Msoleni mkamuwambe mna msalaba mwemwe muwenyegho. Sonile bae ghomba lya kumhigha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wayahudi wamwidika, “Twetwe tuna Laghitso, na kwa Laghitso alyo kobamighwa yafe, kwaapfila tsakalonga yeye ka Imwana we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pilato haulike apfi, kapfuka ghendo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kengila keli mng'anda kamghutsa Yesu, “Angu ulawila kwani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni Yesu ng'edike bae. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilato kamlongela, “Kwolema kulonga na nene? Ng'umanyile bae ka nina uwetso wa kukulekelela au kukuwamba mna msalaba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kuna uwetso wa kunihigha kwaapfila kwing'ighwa uwetso awo ne Imulungu. Apfo ayula iyangalile kuna ghweghwe kana nzambi ng'ulu ng'ani.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato hayahulike apfi, kabama nzila ya kumlekelela Yesu. Lekeni Wayahudi wadama, “Ung'amlekelela, ghweghwe si sale wa mndewa wa Roma bae! Imunu wowose iyolonga ka imndewa komlema mndewa wa Roma!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato hayahulike apfi, kamghala Yesu kunze, kakala mne ichighoda cha mlamutsi hanu hamanyike ka “Chibwalu che Ghamabwe.” Kwa Chihebulaniya “Gabatsa.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ikala saa sita nemisi, litsuwa lya kuiyandaa Ipasaka. Pilato kawalongela Wayahudi, “Ayuno ano imndewa wenu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lekeni Wayahudi wakemelela, “Mkome! Mkome! Mumuwambe mna msalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato kawaghutsa, “Mwombama nimuwambe imndewa wenu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Iwatambika wakulu wamwidika, “Twetwe twahela imndewa yungi ila imndewa wa Roma yaliheka!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Pilato kamlapfa Yesu, kaweng'a wakamuwambe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambighwa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:32-44; Maliki 15:21-32; Luka 23:26-43)</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya asikali wamsola Yesu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Naye kalawa aku kaughala msalaba wake, kughenda hanu hakemighwe Bombwe lya Litwi. Kwa Chihebulaniya hokemighwa Goligota. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Baho wamuwamba Yesu mna msalaba, pfipfila tsawawawamba iwanu weli, yumwe ubali ungi na yungi ubali ungi, Yesu haghatighati. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato kandika chitango kachika mna msalaba. Kandika, “Yesu wa Natsareti, Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wayahudi wengi wachisoma chitango chino, kwaapfila hanu hayawambighwe Yesu kukala habehi na ghumji, na chitango chandikighwa kwa Chihebulaniya, Chilatini na Chigiriki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iwatambika wakulu wamlongela Pilato, “Leka kwandika ‘Imndewa wa Wayahudi,’ ila imunu yuno tsakalonga yeye ka imndewa wa Wayahudi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato kawedika, “Chanyandike, nyandika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asikali hawamuwambile Yesu, wasola ghamaghwanda ghake, waghaghola mabughulu mane, chila bughulu kwa asikali yumwe. Pfipfila wasola na lighwanda lyake ing'alisonighwe bae, ilifumighwe kwandusila mchanya mbaka hasi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asikali welongetsa, “Tuleke kulidegha, leka tutowe simbi tulole yuhi yatsolipata.” Ilawila pfino ili ghatimile Ghamaandiko Maenzeluka igholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Wegholela ghamaghwanda ghangu</para>
  <para style="q">lighwanda lyangu walitowela simbi.”</para>
  <para style="m">Apfi pfipfo pfawatendile asikali awo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Habehi na msalaba wa Yesu tsawema mai wake, lumbu wa mai wake na Mariya mwehe wa Kileopa, na Mariya Magidalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu hawonile mai wake ne imwanang'ina wake iyamnoghele wema hala, kamlongela mai wake, “Mai, ayuno iyo imwanagho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela imwanang'ina wake, “Ayuno ano iyo mai wako.” Kulawa baho, imwanang'ina ayo kamsola Mariya, kakala naye ukaye yake.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:45-56; Maliki 15:33-41; Luka 23:44-49)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu tsakamanya ka ghose ghatimila, ili Ghamaandiko Maenzeluka ghatimile, Yesu kalonga, “Nakwona ng'ilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hanu hala tsahakala na siki, apfo wapfabika lidodoki mne siki, walika mne lubiki lwa msopo, wamwikila mumlomo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu hayafonzile siki ayo kalonga, “Ghatimila.” Kenamisa litwi lyake, kafa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohomighwa mlubapfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tsalikala Litsuwa lya Kwiyandaa, na litsuwa liwinzile likala Litsuwa lya Sabato. Iwakulu we Wayahudi ng'awabamile bae ng'uli tsisighale mna misalaba mne Litsuwa lya Sabato. Kwaapfila Litsuwa lya Sabato tsalikala litsuwa kulu. Wayahudi wamlomba Pilato ghamaghulu ghe iwanu iwawambighwe ghabenighwe, kuya mitufi yawo ihulumsighwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Apfo asikali waghenda, waghabena ghamaghulu gha imunu wa mwanduso iyawambighwe na Yesu, kuya waghabena ghamaghulu gha ayula yungi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni hawapfikile kwa Yesu wampfika ma kafa, ng'awabenile bae ghamaghulu ghake. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Asikali yumwe kamuhoma Yesu mlubapfu kwa mghowa, bahala ilawa idamu na ghamatsi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Imunu iyonile ichilawile katulongela ukalangama tutoghole. Na acho chayalongile kalongesa, kuya yeye komanya ka kolongesa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ilawila pfino Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimile, igholonga, “Kuduhu mpate wake yautsobenighwa.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka gholonga keli, “Watsomlola imunu yula iwamuhomile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsikighwa mmango</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 27:57-61; Maliki 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hambele, Yosefu imunu iyolawila ghumji ghwa Arimataya, kamlomba Pilato amwing'e lukuli lwa Yesu. Yosefu tsakakala imwanang'ina wa Yesu kwa chinyelenyele kwaapfila tsakawapfuka iwakulu wa Wayahudi. Pilato kamlongela Yosefu alusole lukuli lwa Yesu, apfo Yosefu kaghenda kalusola lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yosefu tsakelongotsa na Nikodemu, imunu yula iyaghendile kwa Yesu chilochilo aho mwanduso. Nikodemu tsakaghala pishi tano tse upfumba iunung'ila iutifighwe ne ubani. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iwanu weli walusola lukuli lwa Yesu, walupfatsa sanda hamwe ne upfumba iunung'ila kwa ichihendo cha Wayahudi cha kutsika. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hanu hayawambighwe Yesu tsakukala na mghunda we mibiki, mumghunda amwo tsakukala na mango lya kutsikila lya sambi, kuduhu imunu iyatsikighwe mmango amwo. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwaapfila likala Litsuwa lya Wayahudi kwitanda, na kwaapfila mango ikala habehi, walwika amwo lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:1-8; Maliki 16:1-8; Luka 24:1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo litsuwa lya mwanduso lya juma, kung'ali ne ichisi, Mariya Magidalena tsakaghenda mne imango, kona libwe lilapfighwa kulawa mne libani lya imango. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Katsuma kaghenda kwa Simoni Petiri ne imwanang'ina yungi, yula iyanoghelighwe na Yesu, kawalongela, “Walusola lukuli lwa Imtwatsa mmango, ng'atumanyile bae wamwikile kwani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kuya Petiri ne imwanang'ina yungi waghenda mmango. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wose weli tsawatsuma, lekeni yula imwanang'ina yungi katsuma kubita Petiri, kalongola kupfika mmango. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kenama kasungulila mghati, tsakona sanda, lekeni ng'engile bae mghati. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya Simoni Petiri, iyakalile kuchughu kwake, kapfika kengila mmango. Kona isanda, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na chighwanda ichohighwe mwitwi mwa Yesu, ng'achikalile bae hamwe ne isanda ila chipfingilisa na chikala chiliyeka. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kuya imwanang'ina yula yungi iyandusile kupfika mmango, pfipfila kengila mghati, kona, katoghola. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tsawang'ali ng'awoghamanya bae Ghamaandiko Maenzeluka ighalongile Yesu kobamighwa yatsilihuke. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kuya iwanang'ina woya ukaye.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:9-10; Maliki 16:9-11)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mariya tsakema kunze mwa imango kolila. Hayang'ali yolila, kenama kasungulila mghati mwe imango, <verse number="12" style="v"/>kawona malaika weli iwapfalile ghamaghwanda matselu, wakala hanu halukalile lukuli lwa Yesu, yumwe tsakakala halikalile litwi, yungi kakala haghakalile ghamaghulu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wamghutsa, “Mai, angu choulila choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mariya kawedika, “Wamsola Imtwatsa wangu, na simanyile bae wamwikile kwani!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kuya Mariya kahunduka kamwona Yesu kema hala, lekeni ng'amanyile ka tsakakala Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa, “Mai, angu choulila choni? Umbama nani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mariya kapfikitsa kolonga ne imbetetsi wa imghunda we imibiki, apfo kamlongela, “Imtwatsa, ka kumsola, nongele umwikile kwani, ng'ende nikamsole.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Mariya!”</para>
  <para style="p">Mariya kamuhundukila kamlongela kwa Chihebulaniya “Raboni!” Mana yake Imlangulitsi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Leka kunikinda, kwaapfila sina ng'ende bae kwa Aba. Ghenda ukawalongele ndughu tsangu nene nakuya kwa Aba wangu na Aba wenu pfipfila, Imulungu wangu na Imulungu wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mariya Magidalena kaghenda kawalongela iwanang'ina ka kamwona Imtwatsa, kawalongela achila Yesu chayamlongele.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(Matei 28:16-20; Maliki 16:14-18; Luka 24:36-49)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mihe ila mne litsuwa lya mwanduso lya juma, iwanang'ina hawetingane hamwe aku imibani ihindighwa kwa kuwapfuka iwakulu we Wayahudi, Yesu katsa, kema mghati mwawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hayamalitse kulonga ghano, Yesu kawalangusa ghamoko ghake na lubapfu lwake. Iwanang'ina tsawadeng'elela hawamwonile Imtwatsa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela keli, “Mkale tseghamba. Ka Aba pfayanitumile nene, na nene nomtumani mwemwe.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kuya kawahumulila, kawalongela, “Bokeleni Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mng'awaleghusila nzambi iwanu, iwanu awo woleghusighwa nzambi, ka ng'amuwaleghusila nzambi, iwanu awo ng'awoleghusighwa nzambi bae.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwanang'ina yumwe mne iwanang'ina kumi na weli, Tomasi, iyakemighwe Basa, ng'awile baho hayatsile Yesu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Apfo iwanang'ina wangi wamlongela, “Tumwona Imtwatsa!”</para>
  <para style="p">Lekeni Tomasi kawalongela, “Ka sitsona bae ng'opfu tsa misumari mne ghamoko ghake na kwika chidole changu mne ng'opfu atso, na kwika ghumoko ghwangu mlubapfu mwake, sitoghola bae.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Haghabitile matsuwa manane iwanang'ina wetingana keli mng'anda, na Tomasi tsakakala nawo. Imibani tsaihindighwa, lekeni Yesu katsa, kema mghati mwawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamlongela Tomasi, “Wike chidole chako hano, ulole ghamoko ghangu, kuya gholosa ghumoko ghwako ughwike mlubapfu mwangu. Leka kulema kutoghola, utoghole!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tomasi kamwidika, “Imtwatsa wangu na Imulungu wangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu kamlongela, “Kwotoghola kwaapfila kumbona? Wabweda awala iwotoghola bila kumbona!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ule ichitabu chino chandikighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu tsakatenda pfihulo pfingi hayakalile ne iwanang'ina wake, ila ng'apfandikighwe bae mne ichitabu chino. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lekeni mbuli tsino tsandikighwa ili mghendelele kutoghola Yesu ka Kiristu Mkombotsi, Imwana we Imulungu na kwa kumtoghola muwe ne ughima kwa ngupfu ya taghwa lyake.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hambele Yesu kawalawila keli iwanang'ina wake mmbalimbali mwa tsimbu Tiberiya. Tsakawalawila pfino, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri, Tomasi iyakemighwe Basa, Nasanaeli iyalawile Kana ghumji ghwa Galilaya, iwana wa Sebedayo, ne iwanang'ina wangi weli wa Yesu wose tsawakala hamwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simoni Petiri kawalongela, “Noghenda kulowa iwasomba.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamlongela, “Twoghenda naghwe.” Apfo wengila mumnumbwi, lekeni chilo chila chose ng'awapatile chinu bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nemitondotondo, Yesu tsakema mmbalimbali mwa tsimbu, lekeni iwanang'ina ng'awamtangile bae ka tsa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Sale tsangu, ng'ampatile chinu bae?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wamwidika, “Ona, ng'atupatile chinu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mwase ichelo lubali lwa kumoso lwe imnumbwi, mtsolowa iwasomba.” Apfo wasa ichelo mmatsi na ng'awadahile bae kukwegha kwaapfila tsawapata iwasomba wengi ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kuya imwanang'ina yumwe, iyanoghelighwe na Yesu kamlongela Petiri, “Ayuno ka Imtwatsa.” Bahala Simoni Petiri ayahulike yula tsakakala Imtwatsa, keyoha lighwanda lyake kwaapfila tsakalitsula. Kuya kadalukila mmatsi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iwanang'ina wangi watsa mne mnumbwi, kwaapfila ng'awakalile hatali ne isi, ila tsawakala utali wa ghamaghulu miya imwe, tsawakwegha ichelo ichimemile iwasomba. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hawapfikile mmbalimbali mwa tsimbu, wona ghumoto na iwasomba wekighwa mchanya mwake, na chighate.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mngaye iwasomba wangi wamlowile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya Simoni Petiri kadina mne mnumbwi, kakwegha ichelo mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ichimemile iwasomba wakulu miya imwe na hamsini na tatu. Hata ka tsakukala ne iwasomba wengi, ichelo ng'achidegheke bae. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mtse mje.” Kuduhu imwanang'ina iyaghetsile kumghutsa, “Ghweghwe uli nani?” Kwaapfila wammanya tsakakala Imtwatsa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu katsa, kasola pfighate ne iwasomba wala, kaweng'a.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Aluno lukala lwakadatu Yesu kuwalawila iwanang'ina wake kulawa hayatsilihuke.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga ne Petiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hawamalitse ukuja, Yesu kamghutsa Simoni Petiri, “Simoni imwana wa Yohane, apfi kwoninoghela kubita wano?”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni Petiri kamwidika, “Ona, Imtwatsa ghweghwe kwomanya ka nene nokunoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlongela, “Wadime iwanang'olo wangu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya Yesu kamghutsa lwa keli, “Simoni imwana wa Yohane, apfi kwoninoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Petiri kamwidika, “Ona, Imtwatsa ghweghwe kwomanya ka nene nokunoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlongela, “Wadime iwang'olo wangu.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu kamghutsa keli lwa kadatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohane, kwoninoghela?”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni Petiri kona usungu kwaapfila Yesu kamghutsa lwa kadatu, “Apfi kwonoghela?” Kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, kwomanya pfinu pfose, kwomanya ka nokunoghela.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu kamlongela, “Wadime iwang'olo wangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nokulongela ghendo, haung'ali msongolo, tsakutsowela kupfala msipi imwenyegho na kughenda hanu haubamile, lekeni hautsolala kutsogholosa ghamoko ghako, imunu yungi katsokwoha na kukughala hanu ng'aubamile bae kughenda.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu kalonga pfino, kulangusa Petiri pfayatsokufa na kumtunitsa Imulungu. Kuya Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwanang'ina wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Petiri kahunduka, kamwona imwanang'ina yula iyanoghelighwe na Yesu kowawinza. Imwanang'ina yuno tsakakala yula iyakalile na Yesu mne ichijo cha Ipasaka na iyamghutsile, “Mtwatsa, yuhi iyatsokuhunduka?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petiri hamwonile, kamghutsa Yesu, “Imtwatsa, ayuno naye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ka nombama akale mghima mbaka hanikuya, ghweghwe ubama choni? Ghwe niwinze!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Apfo mbuli tsenela kwa wandughu kuwa imwanang'ina yula ng'atsakufa bae. Lekeni Yesu ng'alongile ka imwanang'ina yuno ng'atsakufa. Bali kalonga, “Ka nombama akale mghima mbaka hanikuya, ghweghwe ubama choni?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayuno iyo imwanang'ina iyalongile agha ghose na kughandika, na twetwe twomanya ghano ghayalongile gholongesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu tsakatenda pfinu pfingi. Pfinu pfose pfing'andikighwe chimwechimwe, isi yose ing'akalile yahela hanu he ukwika ipfitabu ipfandikighwe.</para>
</usx>
